<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- Kimbu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Maluko</para>
  <para style="toc1">Empola Nsoga kete venaa yaleyandekhwa no Maluko</para>
  <para style="toc2">Maluko</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mal</para>
  <para style="mt2">Empola Nsoga yenaa aleyandekhwaa no</para>
  <para style="mt1">Maluko</para>
  <para style="imt">Olongoli</para>
  <para style="ip">Mpola Nsoga yenaa aleyandekhwaa no Maluko a ketabu kemwi chawe mo vetabu venee venaa vepwale kho Ilekhaano Ipyaa venaa vekhopalela wome wa Yesu Kilisto. Kela kemwi kekhwetwaa “Injili” emaana yakwe, “Mpola Nsoga” vetabu eve alevyandekhwa no Mateo, Maluko, Luka no Yohana panaa Yesu aleafwaga. Ketabu eke cha Maluko achenee kekupe modugo khokela vetabu viinge vinee vya Injili. Vantu vakhogoomba kete ketabu eke achenee alechalongola khwandekwa khokela viinge. Alechandekhwa pakhate ya mwakha wa makomi sita ne jetaano mpakha mwakha wa makomi saba panaa Yesu angile alelagwaa. Vamanyi vinki vakhopaala kete ketabu eke alechandekhwa kho nse ya Lumi ili khovapeela ngulu vanaa vakhomogoomba Kilisto vanaa alevapwale okhoo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Maluko yunaa khotambolwaa kete Yohana Maluko angile khomolonda Paulo no Balinaba, ila mpola jakwe alejanonwaa panaa aleasitaa khwilongolya no Owasi wa Paulo kho mateengi ga Mpola Nsoga ganaa gapwale kho ketabu cha Manoji 13:13. Khanke Maluko aleanojaa mosenjo goonge no Balinaba, kho Manoji 15:37-39. Maluko angile molaasi wa pepi wa Petulo, 1 Petulo 5:13. Kho ketabu eke, Maluko khokhamelelyaa modugo mpola jenaa jekhopogiwaa jiwee Mohemba wa Yesu, ne malaangi ga Yesu ganaa gakhopalela nsiko ja odugo.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ganaa gapwale</para>
  <para style="io">Kho osho 1:1-13, Maluko khoketembolaa ketabu.</para>
  <para style="io">Khanke kho osho 1:14-8:21, Maluko khopalelaa milemo ja Yesu panaa aleapwale Galilaya.</para>
  <para style="io">Apenee kho osho 8:22-10:52, khopalelaa mosenjo gwa Yesu khopeta Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="io">Kho 11:1-16:8, Maluko khomalelyaa khwa khwandekha nsiko ja Yesu panaa aleapwale Yelusalemu, palomwi ne ncha no khofufokha khwa Yesu.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s">Yohana Mobatiji khotengelaa vantu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mateo 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yohana 1:19-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Owo awenee mwandyo wa Mpola Nsoga ya Yesu Kilisto, Mwana wa Matuunda. <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Yandilyee kete venaa aleyandekhwa kho ketabu cha Isaya molagoli wa Matuunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:2">“Matuunda aleapalaa, ‘Ambotoma mokhombe waane akholongole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:2">nanoyo khakhonogelelya njela yakhoo.’<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />Lolii lwa muntu kheetaa pitenengwa, kepalaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:3">‘Momonogelelye Odaada njela yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:3">golooli vejela visoga monaa alakela!’ ”<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Yohana Mobatiji aleijaa pitenengwa, avatengela vantu vapaale mabe gawe no khogalekha, apenee voojwe ili Matuunda avasamehi mabe gawe. <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Vantu vinki khopuma kho nse ya Yudea no khopuma khwiihala Yelusalemu, alevapeta khwakwe, vagoomba kete vatite mabe, apenee avojaa kho lweje Yolodani.<verse eid="MRK 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Yohana angile kholyalaa mwenda gonaa alegwanogelelwa kho wage wa ngamia, no khwituunga mokhanki gwa ntila pa kewino chakwe, ne endya yakwe angile mpandi no woke gwa mwipolu. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Yohana alekhotengaa khwa khopaala, “Nkha ituungo itale, aliija muntu yunaa atite ngulu khokela onene, yunaa nkhalomwa khosunama no khotungola ngosa ja ntanjee jakwe. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Onene nkhovoja kho meje, ila omwene alavoja kho Moye wa Matuunda.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khoojwaa no khogemwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:13-4:11">Mateo 3:13-4:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21">Luka 3:21</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4:1-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Kho nsiko ejoo, Yesu aleapuma kho ihala la Nazaleti wonaa opwale kho nse ya Galilaya, nanoyo abatijwaa no Yohana Mobatiji kho lweje Yolodani. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Yesu panaa aleagungumukhaa mo meje, aleawonaa khochanya khwa Matuunda khokhodigokha no Moye wa Matuunda khomotelemokelaa pachanya yakwe kete njewa. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Lolii khopuma khochanya khwa Matuunda aleyategelekha, yenaa kepalaa, “Ogwegwe amwene Mwanaane mosoga, yunaa natogajwaa nagwe.”<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Timpu Moye wa Matuunda amolongolaa Yesu no khomokenkha pitenengwa, <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />aleikhalaa okhoo khwi ituungo la nsiko alobaini, alekhogemwaa no Khatawe. Nanoyo angile palomwi ne ndimwana ja mwipolu, ne vatomami va pachanya va Matuunda aleviija khomotomekela.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khovetaa valui vanee vawee vahemba vakwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:12-22">Mateo 4:12-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14">Luka 4:14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 4:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">5:1-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Panaa nsiko nyinki alejekela, Yohana aleatungagwaa mo khandulunge, khwi ituungo eloo Yesu aleapetaa kho nse ya Galilaya khoteenga Mpola Nsoga ya Matuunda, apalaa, <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />“Nsiko japikhaga, wami wa Matuunda watelelaga. Palagi mabe genyu no khogalekha, moegombe Mpola Nsoga ya Matuunda!”<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Yesu Panaa alekhokelaa mompelo ya ikhwa la Galilaya, aleavawonaa valui vawele, Simoni no Andelea modogwakwe vakholuwa nshe khwa migonyo. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Yesu avawelaa, “Ndondi, nane ambanoja khovaleeta vantu khwaane, kete valui venaa vakholeeta nshe.” <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Apaponye alevalekha migonyo yawe, vamoloonda Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Yesu panaa aleatelelaa paulongolo kedo, aleavawonaa vadogwakwe, Yakhobo no Yohana, vanaa angile vana va zebedayo, vapwale mwipogo yawe vakhwandaa migonyo jawe. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Apaponye Yesu aleavetaa, nanevo alevamolekha daada yawe Zebedayo mwipogo palomwi ne vatomami vakwe, vamoloonda Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khomopumya muntu idemi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luka 4:31-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Yesu ne vahemba vakwe alevapikha kho ihala ya Kapelanaumu, panaa aleyapikhaa Nsiko ya Khosuupa, Yesu aleingelaa mo nyoomba yenaa alevakhwitangela Vayahudi andyaa kholaanga. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Vantu vensi alevakhumya venaa angile kholangaa, kho nguno angile akhakholigaa kete valaangi va njaanga ja Musa, ila angile kholangaa kete muntu yunaa atite olaala.<verse eid="MRK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Ituungo alelonye, kho nyoomba yakhwitangela Vayahudi aleapwale muntu yomwii yunaa angile asalenkanagwaa ne idemi, alekhokowa madoolo. <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />Aleapalaa, ogwegwe Yesu wa Nazaleti, “Okhopooga chanuu khwisu, mbi wijaga okhowolage? Khomanyile kete ogwegwe ananuu, ogwegwe amwenee yunaa otomilwe no Matuunda!”<verse eid="MRK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Ila Yesu alealekhakela idemi eloo, no kholewela, “Pombolaa myaa! Upume khwa muntu oyo!”<verse eid="MRK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Apenee idemi eloo alelandyaa khomogayanja muntu oyoo, akhotaa kho lolii ikolo apenee idemi lamopuma. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Vantu vensi alevakhumyaa no khwiwolya, “Mpola kee eje? Ega a malaangi mapyaa ganaa gatite olaala! Khogaloma ninga mademi khopuma nanego gakhopuma!”<verse eid="MRK 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Mpola ja Yesu alejasambala nyango kho lwande jensi ja ihala la Galilaya.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khovapon'yaa vantu vinki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mateo 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luka 4:38-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Apaponye alevapuma kho nyoomba yakhwitangela Vayahudi, angile valepalomwi no Yakhobo no Yohana, vapeta kho khaye khwa Simoni no Andelea. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Okhoo mokhoyakwe no Simoni angile agonagaa pa ketanda oko alwalagaa homa nkhaka, vamoweela Yesu mpola eyoo, ituungo aleloo. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Yesu aleamopetela maye oyoo, amowambaa mokhono no khomonyanyola, ne apaponye aleaponaa no khwandya khovatomekela.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Misee, panaa lyonse angile lagwilaga, Yesu angile aletelwaa valwile vensi ne vantu vanaa alevasalenkenaga ne mademi. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Vantu vinki va nse eyoo, alevikhongan'ya panji ya molyango wa nyoomba ya Simoni no Andelea. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Nanoyo Yesu aleavapon'yaa vantu vinki malwile gawe gensi, aleagadaga ne mademi, ila aleakhaloma vapaale kento chechensi kho nguno alevamomanyile omwene ananuu.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khotengaa kho nse ya Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luka 4:42-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Igolo lakwe makingilima, Yesu alealawelaa no khowookha khopeta kholoomba khonaa alepatokhola vantu. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Simoni ne vayakwe alevapeta khomopooga. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Panaa alevamowona, vamowelaa, “Kela muntu khokhopogaa.”<verse eid="MRK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Yesu avawelaa, “Khopetage kho mahala gaange ga pepi nojee malaangi no khwene, kho nguno nijaga kho molemo ogoo.”<verse eid="MRK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Apenee apetaa kho lwande jensi ja nse ya Galilaya, andyaa khoteenga kho nyoomba jawe ja khwitangela Vayahudi no khopumya mademi.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khomopon'yaa molwile wa malimwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mateo 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luka 5:12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Molwile yomwii wa malimwa aleamopetela Yesu amotungamela no khomoloomba, “Mbe khotogwa, nkholoomba onoje ngombwe khomokumbekha Matuunda.”<verse eid="MRK 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Yesu amowonela losongo muntu oyoo, agololaa mokhono gwakwe, amopalyaa no khomoweela, “Nkhopooga! Ogoombwe khomokumbekha Matuunda!” <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Apaponye aleaponaa egoo malimwa, agombiwa khomokumbekha Matuunda. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Yesu amokhakela vikhamu, apenee amowelaa awooke, <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />aleamowelaa, okhamowele muntu yeyensi mpola eje, petagaa wilagele kho mopumya matambekho molaala no khopumya sadakha khwa khogoombwa khwakhoo khomokumbekha Matuunda, kete venaa Musa alealagelelya ili vanto vensi vawone.<verse eid="MRK 1:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Ila muntu oyoo aleapetaa, andyaa khosambalya mpola ejo kho lwande jensi no khopaala mpola nyinki ja Yesu, gechoo Yesu aleakhonya khwingela khaye yeyensi pa welo, alomaa khwikhala khotale khonaa angile khotokhola vantu. Ninga gechoo, vantu alevamopetela khopuma kho lwande nyinki.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s">Yesu khomopony'aa molwile yunaa apolile</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mateo 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luka 5:17-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Nsiko ntiiti panaa alejakela Yesu aleatuwaa kapelanaumu, vantu alevategeela kete aleatuwagaa khonaa khikhalaga. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Vantu vinki alevijola mukhate ninga nyafasi yaawa khotopo kho molyango. Nanoyo avatengela vantu Mpola Nsoga, <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Ituungo aleloo vantu alevamoleeta molwile yomwii yunaa angile apolile, aleakepolagwaa ne vantu vanee. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Kho nguno angile khopwale idale ikolo la vantu alevakhonya khomopicha molwile pepi no Yesu. Apenee alevaloma khodola idoli edali la ituntuga panaa Yesu aleapwale. Alevamotelemola molwile oyoo oko agonile kho ketanda cha ngosa. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Yesu panaa aleawonaa khogoomba khwawe, aleamowelaa molwile oyoo yunaa aleapolile, “Mwanaane, wawochelajwaa mabe gakhoo.” <verse eid="MRK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Valaangi vamoonga va njaanga ja Musa vanaa angile vikhalaga epoo, alevandya khosiima momeoyo jawe. <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />“Kho kee muntu oyo khopalaa gechoo? Epoo khomotokhaa Matuunda! Khotopo muntu yunaa nokhowola khopumya mabe ga vantu, ila topo Matuunda mwenee alemwii!”<verse eid="MRK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Apaponye Yesu aleamanya kenaa valaangi va njaanga ja Musa alevakhosiima, apenee aleavawela, “Kho kee mokhosiima gechoo momeoyo jenyu? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Mbi, mpola kee yenaa amba mpelu, Khomoweela muntu oyo yunaa apolile, ‘Wawochelajwa mabe gakhoo,’ ao khomoweela, ‘Imelela, usole ketanda chakhoo opete?’ <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Ila nkhopooga omanye kete Mwana wa Muntu atite olaala wa khowochaa mabe kho vantu va liwelelo.” Yesu aleamowela muntu oyoo yunaa apolile, <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />“Nkhokowelaa, imelela, usole ketanda chakhoo opete khokhaye yakhoo!”<verse eid="MRK 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Apaponye vantu vensi panaa alevakhomokuuna, muntu oyoo aleimelela no khosola ketanda chakwe no khowookha, vantu vensi alevakhumyaa no khomokholya Matuunda khwa khopaala, “Khokale khowonage mpola kete eye.”<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khomosagolaa Lawi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mateo 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luka 5:27-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Yesu aleatuwaa khanke khompelo ya ilambo lya Galilaya, idale ikolo la vantu alelamopetela, apenee nanuyo aleandyaa khovaliga. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Panaa alekhokela, aleamowona Lawi mwana wa Alufayo, ikhalagaa palwande ya khokhonganelya ikodi. Yesu amowela ndondee apenee Lawi aleimelelaa no khomolonda.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Apenee Yesu panaa angile kholyaa endya mokhaye ya Lawi, vakhongan'yaa kodi vinki palomwi ne vanaa alevatite mabe, angile vakholya palomwi no Yesu ne vahemba vakwe, kho nguno angile khole vantu vinki vanaa angile vakhomoloonda. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Apenee valaangi vamoonga va njaanga ja Musa angile Mafalisayo panaa alevamowona Yesu kholyaa palomwi ne vantu vanaa alevatite mabe ne vakhongan'yaa kodi alevavawolya vahemba vakhwe, “Kho kee Yesu kholyaa palomwi ne vakhongan'yaa kodi palomwi ne vantu wa mabe?”<verse eid="MRK 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Yesu panaa aleategela egoo, aleavawelaa, “Vantu vanaa nkha valwile vakhamoloma mogaanga, ila vanaa valwile topo. Alenkiija kho nguno ya khoveeta vantu vanaa vatokhola mabe, ila vantu vanaa vatite mabe.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khowolwaa mpola ja khwiyiima kholya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mateo 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luka 5:33-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Vahemba va Yohana ne vahemba va Mafalisayo angile vakhwiyiima kholya. Apene vantu vaange aleviija vamowolya Yesu, “Kho kee vahemba va Yohana ne Mafalisayo vakhwiyiima kholya, ila vahemba vakhoo vakhavakhwiyiima kholya?” <verse eid="MRK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Yesu aleavawolya, “Vahenja va mwenga wa kegwisha aviyiima mbi kholya oko vapwale no mwenga wa kegwisha? Ituungo lensi panaa valaawa no mwenga wa kegwisha khotopo viyiime kholya. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Ila ituungo lelapikha panaa mwenga wa kegwisha alalejwa khwawe, epoo papene valiyiima kholya.”<verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />Khotopo muntu yunaa khodomula kelakha cha mwenda mopyaa no khokesunela pa mwenda mosakhalu. Mbe khanoja gechoo, kelakha echoo keladewokha, no mwenda ogoo golongelekha khodewokha. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Avivyoo khotopo muntu yunaa alatole divai mpyaa kho mefukho mesakhalu ja ntila, mbe khanoja gechoo, divai mpyaa elademola mefukho eyoo, divai eliitekha ne mefukho ja ntila ilanonekha, ila divai mpyaa ketolwaa kho mefukho mepyaa ja ntila.<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khowolwaa mpola ya Nsiko ya Khosuupa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mateo 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luka 6:1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Nsiko yemwi ya Khosuupa, Yesu palomwi ne vahemba vakwe angile vakhokela pakhate ya mogoonda gwa ngano. Panaa angile vakhokela momogoonda, vahemba vakwe alevandya khowuna mateende ga ngano ili valye. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Mafalisayo alevamowolya Yesu, “Kunaa, kho kee vahemba vakhoo vakhotomama melemo jenaa jekhalomwa khotomamwa Nsiko ya Khosuupa?”<verse eid="MRK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Yesu avawelaa, “Mbi, mokhasoma venaa aleanojaa Daudi palomwi ne vayaakwe panaa alevatite njala? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Abiasali panaa alemopumya matambekho molaala wa Matuunda, Daudi aleingelaa mo nyoomba ya Matuunda alya mekhate eyoo yenaa angile avalyaga vapumya matambekho valaala va Matuunda topo, ila Daudi angile alyaa no khovapeela vayaakwe.”<verse eid="MRK 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Apenee Yesu avawelaa, “Nsiko ya Khosuupa aleyatolwaa kho nguno ya vantu, ila nkha Nsiko ya Khosuupa kho nguno ya vantu. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Kho gechoo, Mwana wa Muntu amwene molaala wa Nsiko ya Khosuupa.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s">Yesu khopon'yaa muntu mokhono wunaa opolile</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mateo 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luka 6:6-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Apenee Yesu aleingela kho nyoomba yenaa alevakhwitangela Vayahudi, no omoo alekhole no muntu yunaa angile apolile mokhono. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Omoo vantu vamoonga angile vamolindile Yesu amopon'ye muntu oyoo Nsiko ya Khosuupa, ili vakhowole khomositacha. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Yesu aleamowela muntu oyoo yunaa aleapolile mokhono, “Wiije epa ili vantu vensi vakhowone.” <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Apenee Yesu avawolya, “Khopumana ne njaanga jisu, khokhopogiwa khonojee mbi Nsiko ya Khosuupa? Mbi, khonojaa masoga ao mabe? Khopon'ya ao khowolaga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 3:4">Ila evenee angile vapombola myaa. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Yesu aleavakunaa vensi khwa kesila, aleasayaa mudugo kho nguno ya okhaku wa meoyo jawe. Apenee amowela muntu oyoo, “Gololaa mokhono gwakhoo!” Nanoyo agololaa mokhono gwakwe, gwawa mopanga khanke. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Apaponye Mafalisayo alevapuma panji, vandyaa khopalana palomwii ne idale la vantu va Helode, vandyaa khopooga njela ya khomowolaga Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Idale la vantu pampelo ya ilambo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Yesu aleawokhaa epoo palomwii ne vahemba vakwe, vapeta pampelo ya ilambo lya Galilaya, ne idale ikolo la vantu alelamolonda. Vantu evoo alevapumelaga Galilaya, Yudea, <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />ne vaange alevapuma Yelusalemu, Idumea, no khopuma lwande jensi ja keeya ya lweje Yolodani ne lwande jensi jenaa jekhopilima ihala la Tilo ne sidoni. Madale egoo gensi ga vantu alegamopetela Yesu kho nguno alevategelaga mpola nyinki jenaa angile khonojaa. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Kho nguno angile khole vantu vinki, Yesu aleavawelaa vahemba vakwe vamwandalele ipogo yemwi, ili idale la vantu likhiije landye khomosunkhanga. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Kho nguno aleapon'yaa vantu vinki, valwile vinki alevandyaa khwisunkhaanga khopeta khonaa apwale Yesu ili vamopalye no khoponiwa malwile ganaa alevakholwaala. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Vantu vanaa angile vasalinkhanaga ne mademi panaa alevamowona Yesu, alevandya khogwa panse paulongolo wakwe no khokowa madoolo, khwa khopaala, “Ogwegwe amwene Mwana wa Matuunda!” <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Ila Yesu aleavagilyaa kho okhakha vakhavawele vantu kete omwene ananuu.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khosagolaa vahemba vakwe ikomi ne vawele</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mateo 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luka 6:12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Yesu aleatantaa paketonda, avetaa evoo vanaa angile avalomagaa viije khwakwe. Nanevo vamopetela, <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />nanuyo asagolaa movamoonga vawe vantu ikomi ne vawele, vanaa aleavetaa vatomwi, avawelaa, “Navasagolaga onywenywe mowe palomwi nane no khovalagelelya mpola nsoga, <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />ne navapelaga olaala wa khopumya mademi.”<verse eid="MRK 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Ne evoo vantu ikomi ne vawele vanaa angile avasagolaga avenee ewa, Simoni yunaa Yesu aleamwetaa Petulo. <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Ne vaange angile Yakhobo no Yohana, vana va Zebedayo, ewa vadogo vawele aleavetaa Boanege, emaana yakwe, “Vana va ngilimo.” <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Avasagolaa no Andelea no Filipo no Batolomayo no Mateo no Tomasi no Yakhobo mwana wa Alufayo no Tadayo no Simoni Moteteli wa nse yakwe. <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />Yuda muntu yunaa khopumelaa ihala la Kalioti, yunaa aleamogalokhaa Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khwipyanekelwa no Beelzebuli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Mateo 12:22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luka 11:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12:10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Apenee Yesu aleatuwaa khonaa angile khikhalaga. Idale la vantu likhongan'yaa khanke, ninga Yesu ne vahemba vakwe alevakhonya kholya endya. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Panaa vadogwakwe Yesu alevategeela mpola ejoo, alevawookha vapeta khomosola kho nguno vantu alevakhopaala asalenkhanagaa.<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Valaangi va njaanga ja Musa vanaa alevakhopuma Yelusalemu, alevapaala, “Oyo atite Beelzebuli, molaala wa mademi, amwenee yunaa khomopelaa olaala wa khopumya mademi.”<verse eid="MRK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Apenee Yesu aleavetaa vantu no khopaala nanevo kho mefwano, “Mbi Khatawe nokhowolaa mbi khwibidinja mwenee? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Mbe vantu va wami womwii vasambanalaga no khwikhowa venee kho venee, wami owoo olalekha khwikhala. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Mbe khaye yemwii ilasambala khotale tale no khwandya khwikowa, odogo owoo olaacha. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Mbe, wami wa Khatawe olasambalana no kholegonkhana, wami owoo olalekha khwikala, no owoo olaawa odugo wakwe.”<verse eid="MRK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />Khotopo muntu yunaa nokhowola khokholanga khaye ya muntu yunaa atite ngulu no khomosukha muntu nsawo yakwe khotopo khomotunga taali oyoo yunaa atite ngulu, papene alakhowola khomosukha nsawo yakwe.<verse eid="MRK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />“Khapanga nkhovaweela, vantu valawochelwa mabe gawe gensi palomwi ne vanaa vakhomotokha Matuunda, <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />ila yunaa khomotokhaa Moye wa Matuunda, alalekha khowochelwaa mabe gakwe wome wakwe wensi, kho nguno muntu yunaa khonojaa gechoo alaawa atite mabe nsiko jakwe jensi ja wome.” <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Yesu aleapalaa gechoo kho nguno vantu alevakhopaala, “Atite idemi.”<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maye ne vadogwakwe Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mateo 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luka 8:19-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Apenee aleviija valuna vakwe Yesu palomwi no maye wakwe, alevimelela panji, vamotoma muntu apete amwete. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Idale la vantu alevikhalaga khomopilima Yesu, nanevo vamowela, “Maye ne valuna vakhoo vapwale panji vakhokhopooga.” <verse eid="MRK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Yesu avawolya, “Maye waane ne valunane a vananuu?” <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Apenee avakunaa vantu vensi vanaa alevamopilimaga, apalaa, “Kunagi! Ewa avenee maye waane ne vadogwane. <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Muntu yeyensi yunaa khonojaa ganaa Matuunda alomile, ewa avenee mokolwane no iloombo lyane no maye waane.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s">Mofwano gwa momiinji</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mateo 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luka 8:4-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Yesu aleandyaa kholiga khanke pampelo ya ilambo la Galilaya. Idale ikolo la vantu alelamopilima ninga alomaa ingele mwipogo no khwikhala. Vantu vensi alevikhalaga pa nse nkhaku, mompelo ya ilambo. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Aleavaligaa mpola nyinki khwa khotomela mefwano, no kho malaangi gakwe, aleavawela.<verse eid="MRK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />“Tegelelaji! Aleapwale momiinji yomwi yunaa aleapetaa khomiinja mbeyo kho mogonda gwakwe. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Panaa alekhominjaa mbeyo, jiinge alejagweela monjela, nyonyi jiija jalyaa. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Jiinge alejagweela mo mogaamba khonaa alekhotopo olongo mwinki, mbeyo ejoo alejaleemba nyango kho nguno angile khotopo olongo mwinki pachanya ya mogaamba. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Ila panaa lyonse angile ikhakha, mimelo aleyandyaa khonyaala no khokhala, kho nguno milii yakwe angile ele pachanya chanya topo. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Mbeyo jiinge alejagwela mo miyaa, miyaa panaa alejakola, aleyaebanaanga mimelo eyoo jilwaa kholela. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Jiinge alejagweela mo olongo mosoga, jaleemba, jakola no kholela, yemwii yalela makomi gatato, yeenge makomi sita ne yeenge igana.”<verse eid="MRK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Apenee Yesu aleapalaa, “Muntu yunaa atite matwi ga khotegeela, ategeele!”<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nguno ya khotomela mefwano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mateo 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9">Luka 8:9</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 8:10">10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Yesu panaa aleasigaa alemwii, vantu vamoonga vanaa alevakhomotegelelya palomwi ne vahemba ikomi ne vawele, alevamopetela no khomowolya nguno ya kholiga khwa mefwano achanuu.? <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Yesu avawelaa, “Onywenywe mwapelwagaa masala ga khomanya mpola jenaa jiswekile kho Wami wa Matuunda, ila vantu vanaa vapwale panji, valawelwa kela kento kho mefwano, <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />kho nguno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">‘Mbe valawona, vawone ila vakhatemboole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">mbe valategela, vategeele ila vakhamanye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">vakhiije vamotuwele Matuunda ili avawochele mabe gawe.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khovapalela emaana ya mofwano gwa momiinji</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mateo 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luka 8:11-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Apenee Yesu aleavawolya, “Mbi, onywenywe mokhamanya mofwano ogo? Molakhowola mbi khomanya mefwano jiinge? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Mbeyo jenaa alejekhomiinjwa no momiinji a Mpola ya Matuunda. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Vantu vaange vakhwipyanekeliwaa no oloongo wa monjela, panaa vakhotegeela Mpola ya Matuunda topo, Khatawe khwiijaa no kholewochaa momeoyo jawe. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Vantu vaange vakhwipyanekeliwaa no olongo wa mogaamba. Panaa vakhotegeela Mpola ya Matuunda, vakhopokeela nyango khwa nsekho, <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />ila vakhavakhotuula momeoyo jawe, kho nguno vapwale kete memelo yenaa itokhola milii, evenee vakhowamba Mpola ya Matuunda khwi ituungo ikupe topo, panaa etaabu ne magayo panaa vekhovapikela, evenee vakholekha khogoomba nyango. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Ila vaange vapwale kete olongo wonaa opwale mo miyaa, vakholetegeela no khopokeela Mpola ya Matuunda, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />ila wowa wa wome ne nsawo nyinki ja wiwi no khotamanela vento viinge ne gechoo vakhokonya kholela viligi. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Ila vaange vapwale kete oloongo wonaa otite lutuba. Evenee vakholiteegela mpola no kholepokeela no kholela, yemwi khelelaa makomi gatato, ne yeenge makomi sita ne yeenge igana.”<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mofwano gwa tala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luka 8:16-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Apenee Yesu aleavawolya khanke, “Mbi, vantu vakhovachaa etala no khojekenkha mokhate no khoikhundekela ne idebe ao khoetuula mo oluungu? Nkha gechoo etala ketolwaa khochanya ya vinsundaa. <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Gechoo chechensi kenaa chaswekilwee kelaumbolwa ne chechensi kenaa alechakundekelwa, kelakundokolwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Muntu yunaa atite matwi ga khotegeela, ategeele.”<verse eid="MRK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Yesu aleavawelaa khanke, “Tegeleli visoga kenaa mokhotegela! Njaanga eyoo yenaa mokhotomela khovatengemekela vaange, Matuunda alatomela ayeyoo khovatengemekela nanywi, khanke alakelelya. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Kho nguno kela yunaa atite chechensi alaongelelwa, ila muntu yunaa atokhola kento, ninga echoo kedo kenaa atite, alasukwa.”<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mofwano gwa mbeyo yenaa ikholemba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Yesu aleendelelaa khopaala, “Wami wa Matuunda wokhwipyaana no muntu yunaa khovyalaa mbeyo momogonda. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Panaa khowaa avyalagaa, otikho khowaa agonile, pa lyonse khowaa miso, ituungo aleloo mbeyo jekholeemba no khokola patokhola omwene khomanya. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Olongo awenee okhojenoja mbeyo jelembe no khokola no kholela endya, mbeyo jekhwandya khopumya matiti makeke, apenee nyangalawe, apenee jekhwija khopumya endya mo nyangalawe. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Endya panaa amba yakhamagaa, molemi khwingelaa momogonda ne nyeengo yakhwembolela endya kho nguno jakhamaga.”<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mofwano gwa mbeyo ja haladali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:31">Mateo 13:31</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:32-34">32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luka 13:18-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Yesu aleapalaa khanke, “Khoopyane Wami wa Matuunda ne kee? Khoopalele khwa mefwano kee? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Wami wa Matuunda ole kete mbeyo ya haladali, yenaa a nndo khokela mbeyo jensi jenaa jekhovyaalwa ne vantu va paliwelo. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Ila panaa kevyalwaa, ikokola no khowaa ipeke ikolo khokela memelo jensi jenaa jekhovyaalwa khomogonda. Matambe gakwe gakhowa makolo ninga nyonyi jekhwija no khonogelelya vetyoo vyawe omoo.” <verse eid="MRK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Yesu aleatomela mefwano minki panaa angile khovatengelaa vantu okhombe wakwe, aleapalaa nanevo venaa alevakhowola khomanya. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Aleakhapala nanevo chechensi patokhola khotomela mefwano, ila panaa angile khosigaa aleemwi ne vahemba vakwe, alekhovapalelaa kela kento mwalyaa.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khoogilya iputa ikhakha khupuuta</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mateo 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luka 8:22-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Mesee ya nsiko ayeyoo, Yesu aleavawela vahemba vakwe, “Kholowoke, khopete kho nkelo ya ilambo.” <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Apenee alevalelekha idale lya vantu, vahemba vakwe aleviingela mwipogo monaa angile apwale Yesu, avivyoo ne mapogo gaange alegalondana nanoyo. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Tiimpu, iputa ikhakha mudugo alelandyaa khoputa, magelekha makolo ga meje alegaesunkha ipogo eyoo ninga khoekenkelelya khwijola meje. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Yesu angile agonilee ndoolo pa mpilimo ya ipogo oko atolagaa motwe gwakwe pa mosago. Apenee vahemba vakwe alevandyaa khomolawelya no khomoweela, “Molaangi, okhamanya kete khokhofwaa?”<verse eid="MRK 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Apenee, alealawela, andyaa kholegilyaa iputa eloo, no khogaloma magelekha makholo ga meje, “Pombolaa! Myaa!” Apenee iputa lapola paawa visoga. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Apenee Yesu aleavawolya vahemba vakwe, “Kho kee mole no wowa? Mbi, mokhale mokhamokhongoomba?” <verse eid="MRK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Epoo alevogopa modugo, vaawa vakhwiwolya, “Mbi oyo a ananuu, yunaa iputa ne magelekha makolo ga meje, vekhomotegelelya?”<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu khomopony'a muntu yunaa atite idemi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mateo 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luka 8:26-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Yesu ne vahemba vakhwe alevapikha kho nse ya Vagelasi, nkelo ya ilambo la Galilaya. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Yesu panaa alekhotelemokha mwipogo, aleitanga muntu yomwi yunaa angile asalenkanaga ne idemi angile apumaga kho makhabuli. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Muntu oyoo alekhwikhala khomakhabuli, khotopo ninga muntu yunaa aleakhowola khomotunga menyololo. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Kho nguno alevakhomotunga empingo ne menyololo, ila kela ituungo alekhojedomola menyololo ne emupingo ejoo, gechoo alekhotopo muntu yeyensi yunaa aleakhowolaa khomogilya. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Lyonse no otikho alekhikhalaga khomakhabuli no khovetonda, okhoo khokowaa madolo no khwidomolanga ne mabwee. <verse eid="MRK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Panaa aleamowonaa Yesu khotale, aleamokembelela no khomotungamela paulongolo wakhwe, <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />apalaa kho lolii nkolo, “Okhopooga onojeee kee nane ogwegwe Yesu, Mwana wa Matuunda yunaa apwale Khochanya Mudugo? Olape kho lina la Matuunda, nkhokholoomba okhandemeke!” <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Aleapalaa gechoo kho nguno Yesu aleamowelaga, “Ogwegwe idemi mopumee muntu oyo.” <verse eid="MRK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Apenee Yesu aleamowolya, “Lina lyakhoo ananuu?” “Nanuyo amowelaa lina lyane a ‘Idale,’ kho nguno khole vinki” <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Apenee aleamolombaa mudugo Yesu akhavadage kho nse eye.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Pepi ne epoo angile khole idale ikolo la magolowe, vakhosoonga kho mosulumokho wa ketonda. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Apenee mademi alegamoloomba, “Okholeke khwingele kho magolowe egoo.” <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Apenee Yesu aleavagombela, papene mademi alegapuma no khwingela kho ngolowe ejoo. Idale lensi la ngolowe jenaa angile kete elufu jewele, latelemokha kho mosulumokho wa ilambo no khotwiina. <verse eid="MRK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Vasoongi va ngolowe ejoo alevakembela, vapeta khovaweela mpola eyoo khwihala no khomengonda. Ne vantu alevapeta khokunaa kenaa alechapumela, <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />panaa alevapikha khwa Yesu, alevamowona muntu oyoo yunaa aleasalinkanaga ne idale lya mademi ikhalaga panse, alyalagaa myenda ne atite masala masoga, vantu vensi alevogopa. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Vantu vanaa viwonile mpola eyoo, alevandyaa khovapalela ne vaange mpola yenaa aleyamopumela muntu oyoo, yunaa aleasalinkanaga ne mademi, ne mpola ja ngolowe ejoo.<verse eid="MRK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Apenee vantu vapooga Yesu awookhe kho nse yawe. <verse eid="MRK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Yesu panaa alekhotantaa mwipogo, muntu oyoo yunaa aleatite mademi, amolombaa vapete nanoyo. <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Ila Yesu aleamositelaa. Apenee amowelaa, “Petagaa khokhaye khwa vadogwako ovawele mpola yenaa Odaada akhonojelaga ne venaa akhowonelaga losongo.” <verse eid="MRK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Apenee muntu oyoo aleapetaa, andyaa khoteenga okhoo Dekapoli, mpola yensi yenaa Yesu aleamonojelaga, vantu vensi alevakhumya. Dekapoli emaana yakwe mahala ikomi.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khomopon'ya mwalele wa Yailo no mokhiima yomwii</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mateo 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luka 8:40-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Yesu alealowokhaa khanke nkelo ya owele ya ilambo khwi ipogo. Idale ikolo la vantu alelikhongany'a paulongolo wakwe, nanoyo awaa imelelagaa pampelo ya ilambo. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Aleijaa muntu yomwii yunaa khwetwaa Yailo, molaala wa nyoomba ya khwitangela Vayahudi. Aleapikhaa epoo, nanoyo panaa aleamowona Yesu, aletungama pamegolo jakwe, <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />amolombaa no khopaala, “Mwalele waane modo a molwile alepepi achee. Nkhokholoomba khopete, omolombele apate khopona no khwikhala.”<verse eid="MRK 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Apenee Yesu awokhaa palomwi nanoyo. Ne idale ikolo la vantu alelamoloonda no khwandya khomobunkhaanga.<verse eid="MRK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Kho idale eloo, alekhole no mokhiima yomwii yunaa angile atite mosongelo khwi ituungo la myakha ikomi ne jewele. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Mokhiima oyoo aleagayagaa mudugo, khwa khopeta khwa vagaanga vinki no khotomela nsawo yakwe yensi. Ila aleakhapona, no olwile wakwe alegokhongelekha. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Mokhiima oyoo aleategelagaa mpola ja Yesu, ne gechoo aleepenyelya mo idale la vantu khopumela khompilimo, no khopalyaa ipeembo la mwenda gwakwe. <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Aleanoja gechoo, kho nguno alekhwipalelaa momooyo gwakwe, “Mbe, mpalye topo ipeembo la mwenda gwakwe, ndapona.”<verse eid="MRK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Apaponye panaa aleapalya ipeembo la mwenda gwa Yesu, mosongelo gwakwe alegwalekha, epoo alekhwitegeela momowele gwakwe aponagaa. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Apaponye Yesu aleamanya kete ngulu jakwe japumaga. Apenee alealegelokela idale eloo la vantu, no khovawolya, “Ananuu yunaa apalyaa mwenda gwaane?”<verse eid="MRK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Vahemba vakwe vamowelaa, “Owine idale la vantu venaa vakhokhosunkhanga, mbi khowolya, ananuu yunaa ampalya?”<verse eid="MRK 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Ila Yesu aleendelela khokuuna lwande jensi, ili amowone ananuu yunaa aleamopalya. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Apenee mokhiima oyoo, oko amanyile kenaa alechamopumelaga, aleapumela oko khotetemaa kho wowa, ijutaa panse paulongolo wa Yesu no khomowela mpola jensi jenaa aleajenogajaa. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Yesu amowelaa, “Mwalele waane, khogoomba khwakhoo khwakhoponyajaa, Petaga ne nseko, opone mosongelo gwakhoo gwensi, okhatuwe khanke.”<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Yesu panaa angile akhale khopalaa, vantu alevapikha khopuma khokhaye khwa Yailo yunaa molaala wa nyoomba ya khwitangela Vayahudi vamoweela, “Mwalele wakho achaga, kho kee khwendelela khomogayanjaa Molaangi?”<verse eid="MRK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Ninga venaa Yesu aleategelaa ganaa alevakhopalaa, aleamogalokela Yailo, amowela, “Okhogope, ogwegwe gombagaa topo.” <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Ninga gechoo, aleakhaloma muntu yeyensi amolonde, ila topo Petulo no Yakhobo no Yohana modogwakwe Yakhobo. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Panaa alevapikha khokhaye khwa Yailo, Yesu aleategelaa madoolo no khowona vantu vakhokhoota no khoombolelya kho lolii nkolo. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Aleingelaa mokhate, avawelaa, “Kho kee mokhokhowa madoolo no khokoota? Mwalele wenyu akhafwa, ila agonilee topo.”<verse eid="MRK 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Ila evenee alevamosekha, apenee aleavapumyaa vensi panji, aleavasolaa maye no daada wa mwalele oyoo palomwii ne evoo vahemba vakwe vatato, avenee vanaa alevingela khombele monaa mwalele oyoo aleapwale. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Apenee amowambaa mokhono oyoo mwalele yunaa aleafwagaa, amowelaa, “Talita, koum,” emaana yakwe, “Mwalele nkhokhoweela lawelaa!” <verse eid="MRK 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Apaponye mwalele oyoo alealawelaa, andyaa khogeenda, nanoyo aleatite myakha ikomi ne jewele, vantu alevakhumyaa modugo panaa alevawona gechoo. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Ila Yesu aleakhaloma vakhamowele muntu yeyensi mpola eyo. Apenee aleavawelaa vamopele mwalele oyoo endya.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s">Yesu khositwaa kho nse ya Nazaleti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mateo 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luka 4:16-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Yesu aleawokhaa Kapelanaumu no khopeta kho ihala la Nazaleti khonaa aleakolelaa, alevilongolya palomwi ne vahemba vakwe. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Nsiko ya Khosuupa panaa aleyapikha, aleandya kholiga kho nyoomba ya khwitangela Vayahudi. Vantu vinki vanaa alevamotegeela venaa kholigaa, alevakhumyaa, vapaala, “Mbi, apataga khwenii mpola eje? Akhowolaa mbi khomanya no khonoja mpola ntembu kete eje? Ninga khonojaa mpola ja khokumya kete eje? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Mbi, oyo nkha amwene moponji, mwana wa Malia, ne valuna vakwe a Yakhobo no Yosefu no Yuda no Simoni? Mbi, ne valombo vakhwe nkha khokhwikhala nanevo apapanye khwisu?” Epoo, aleavasimbyaa.<verse eid="MRK 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Yesu avawela, “Mokuuni wa Matuunda khokoliwaa kho vantu vensi, ila topo kho ihala lakwe no khovadogwakwe no khokhayaawe.”<verse eid="MRK 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Kho gechoo, Yesu aleakhanoja ituntumu lelensi okhoo, ila alekhovatolelaa mekhono valwile vatiiti no khovapon'ya. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Yesu aleakhumya kho nguno vantu alevakhavakhomogoomba.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 6:6">Yesu khovatomaa vahemba ikomi ne vawele</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mateo 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luka 9:1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Kho gechoo Yesu aleapetaa kho khaye jenaa angile jele pepi kho nguno ya khovaliga vantu. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Apenee avakhongan'yaa vahemba vakwe ikomi ne vawele, avagawaa vantu vawele vawele. Avatomaa no khovapeela olaala wa khopumelyaa mademi, <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />aleavawelaa, “Kho mosenjo gwenyu mokepolage nkhome ya khogendela topo, ila mokhakepole endya, ntungate ninga khokepola mpia, <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Mwiije molyalage ntanjee, ila mokhiije mokepolage ikhoti lya akiba.” <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Aleavawela khanke, “Pepeensi panaa molawelwa khaliwo pakhaye, mwiije mwikhalage kho nyoomba eyoo, mpakha panaa molawokha ihala eloo. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Pepeensi panaa molapikha mbe vantu valasita khovapela khaliwo no khovategelelya, panaa molawokha epoo, mwiije mokun'guntage lonkhonde lonaa lolaawa lopwale momegolo jenyu, khovalageela kete Matuunda amwenee alavatengemekha.”<verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Apenee vawookha, vawatengela vantu vapaale mabe gawe gensi no khogalekha. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Alevapumyaa mademi minki kho vantu no khovapakha valwile vinki makhuta ga muzeituni no khovapon'ya.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ncha ya Yohana Mubatiji</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mateo 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luka 9:7-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Apenee, mwami Helode aleategelaa egoo kho nguno lina la Yesu alelasambalaga lwande jensi. Vantu vamoonga alevakhopaala, “Yohana Mubatiji afufokhagaa khopuma kho vachi, avyenee ngulu jakwe alejekhotomama melemo mokhate yakwe.”<verse eid="MRK 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Vaange alevakhopaala, “Muntu oyo a Elia.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:15">Ne vaange alevakhopaala, “Oyo a mokuuni wa Matuunda a yomwii wawe wa vakuuni va myakha va Matuunda.” <verse eid="MRK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Ila Helode panaa aleategelaa mpola eje, aleapalaa, “Oyo amwenee Yohana Mobatiji, yunaa alenamodomula itwe, afufokhagaa.” <verse eid="MRK 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Kho nguno Helode amwenee yunaa alealagelelajaa Yohana Mubatiji agwelwee no khotuungwa mokhandulunge. Helode aleanojaa gechoo kho nguno aleamotolagaa Helodia yunaa angile moliji wa Filipo modogwaakwe Helode. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Kho nguno Yohana angile khamowelaga Helode, “Njaanga kegilyaa khotoola moliji wa modogwakhoo.”<verse eid="MRK 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Gechoo, Helodia angile atite ikuwo no Yohana, apogaa ninga khomowolaga, ila aleakhakhowola khomowolaga. <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />Helode alekhomogopaa Yohana, kho nguno aleamomanyile kete angile muntu wa Matuunda yunaa angile khogombwaa paulongolo wa Matuunda, gechoo alekhwangalelaa wome wa Yohana. Helode aleamowonela losongo modugo Yohana no khwitegeela vibe. <verse eid="MRK 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Apenee mwami Helode alenonojaa weenga wa nsiko ya kholelwaa khwakwe, aleavalalekhaa valaala va wami wakwe vanaa alevalepanse yakwe, valaala va masinjala ne valaala vakolo va Galilaya, apenee Helodia aleapataa njela ya khomowolaga Yohana. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Mwalele wakwe Helodia panaa aleingelaa no khwandyaa khwigeeya, amotojwaa modugo Helode palomwi ne vahenja vakwe vanaa alevalalekhagwa pa endya. Mwami aleamowelaa mwalele oyoo, “Ndombee chechensi kenaa khopogaa, nane ankhopelaa.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Helode aleamowela khwa kholapa, “Chechensi kenaa khondomba, ndakhopela, nkhankowola ninga khogawa wami waane pakhate no khokhopeela.”<verse eid="MRK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Apenee mwalele oyoo apetaa khomowolya maye wakwe, “Ndoombe kee?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:24">Maye wakwe amowelaa, “Petaa oloombe itwe la Yohana Mubatiji.”<verse eid="MRK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Mwalele oyoo aleatuwa nyango no khomowela mwami Helode, “Nkhopooga onepele itwe la Yohana Mubatiji, mo losela ituungo aleele.” <verse eid="MRK 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Mwami aleasaya mudugo, ila kho nguno alemwapelagaa, kho nguno ya vahenja vakwe, aleakhapooga khomositela. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Apaponye mwami aleavalagelelyaa masinjala vapete vadomule itwe la Yohana no khokeleeta. Sinjala yomwii apetaa khodomola itwe la Yohana mokhandulunge, <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />apenee akeletaa molosela amopelaa mwalele, no mwalele oyoo amopelaa maye wakwe. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Vahemba va Yohana Mubatiji panaa alevapata mpola ejoo, alevapeta khosola mowele gwakwe no khowotuula mokhabuli.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khovapelaa endya vantu elufu jitaano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mateo 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohana 6:1-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Vatomwi alevatuuwa no khwikhongan'yaa paulongolo wa Yesu, vamowela gensi ganaa alevaganogaja no kholiga. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Kho nguno vantu vinki alevakhwija no khowookha, ninga vaawa vatokhola nyafasi ya kholyaa, epoo papene Yesu aleavawela vahemba vakwe, “Khopetagi kholeemwi khonaa patokhola vantu, mopete mosuupe.” <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Apenee, alevawookha valeemwi khwipogo, vapeta khonaa alekhotokhola vantu. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Ila vantu vinki alevawona panaa alevapetile no khovamanya. Gechoo, vantu va khopuma nse nyinki, alevakembela no kholongola khopikha khonaa Yesu ne vahemba vakwe angile vapetile. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Yesu panaa aleapikhaa nse nkhaku no kholewona idale la vantu, aleawaonela losongo, kho nguno angile vapwale kete nkholo jenaa jetokhola mosongi. Apenee aleandyaa khovaliga mpola nyinki. <verse eid="MRK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Lyonse panaa angile lekhopooga khogweela. Vahemba alevamopetela Yesu, vamoweela, “Epa khole khotale ne khaye ja vantu, ne seji a mesee. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Vawelee vantu vapete kho mahala ne lwande ja pepi ili vigolele endya.”<verse eid="MRK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Ila Yesu avawelaa, “Vapelagi nywenywee endya.” Nanevo vamowolya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:37">“Mbi, khopete khogole mikate ja magana gawele ga madini ga mpia? Mpia ejoo amba nyinki khogolela endya vantu vensi ewa.”<verse eid="MRK 6:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Yesu avawolyaa, “Motite mikate jiinga? Petagi mokuune.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:38">Ne panaa alevakuuna, vatuuwa no khomowela, “Jepwale mekhate jetano ne nshe jewele.”<verse eid="MRK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Apenee, Yesu avalagelelyaa vahemba vawawele vantu vensi vikhale mo malondo londo pa masanje masapu. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Nanevo alevikhala kho malondo ga vantu igana ne vaange alevikhala vantu makomi gataano. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Yesu aleasolaa eyoo mikate jetaano ne nshe jewele, akunaa khochanya, amosongela Matuunda no khwandya khoemeganyaa mikate no khovapela vahemba vakhwe ili vawapele vantu vensi ne nshe ejoo jewele aleajemeganyaa no khovagawela jensi. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Vantu vensi alevalyaa no kwikota. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Vahemba vakwe alevakongan'yaa nshe ne mikate jenaa alejasigaga no khovijolyaa vekhapu ikomi ne vewele. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Vagwisha vanaa alevalya endya angile elufu jetaano.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khogendaa pachanya ya meje</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mateo 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yohana 6:15-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Apaponye Yesu aleavawela vahemba vakwe vataante mwipogo valongole khopeta Betisaida nkelo ya ilambo, panaa omwenee angile khodayaa idale ikolo la vantu. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Panaa aleamalyaa khovadayaa vantu evoo, aleapetaa kho ketonda kholoomba. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Panaa aleyapikhaa mesee, ipogo eyoo aleyapikhaga pakhate pi ilambo, Yesu aleasigagaa aleemwi kho nse nkaku. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Yesu avawonaa vahemba vakwe venaa angile vakhogayaa khokowa mentinkho khoelongolya ipogo, kho nguno iputa angile lekhovagilya khopeta paulongolo. Pepi ne makingilima, epoo papenee Yesu avapetela vahemba vakwe, oko khogendaa pachanya ya meje. Angile pepi avakele. <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />Ila panaa alevamowona khogendaa pachanya ya meje, alevasiima hamo isambwaa, vandyaa khohuuma. <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />Kho nguno vensi alevamowona, alevogopa mudugo. Apaponye Yesu apalaa nanevo, “Mokhagaye, nenee, mokhanyogope!” <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Apenee aleingela mwipogo yenaa alevapwale ne iputa lyapola. Nanevo alevakumyaa modugo, <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />kho nguno alevakhale vamanye venaa Yesu aleanogelelaja mikate eyoo, alevakhakhowola khoemanya mpola eyoo.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khopon'yaa valwile kho nse ya Genesaleti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Mateo 14:34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Panaa alevalowokha ilambo, alevapikha nse ya Genesaleti, veemya ipogo yawe. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Panaa alevakhotelemokha khopuma mwipogo yawe, apaponye vantu alevamomanya Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Apenee vantu evoo vandyaa khopilima lwande ja nse yensi no khovakepola valwile mo vegonelo vyawe, vawakenkha lwande jensi jenaa Yesu aleapwale. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Lwande jensi jenaa Yesu angile apetaa, kho mahala ne khaye no kho megoonda, vantu alevawakenkha valwile kho lwande yenaa vantu angile vakhogola no khogolya vento no khwandyaa khomoloomba Yesu avawele valwile vamopalye ninga ipeembo la mwenda gwakwe. Vantu vensi vanaa alevamopalya alevapona.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s">Mapokeelo ga makoko</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Mateo 15:1-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Mafalisayo vamoonga ne valaangi va njaanga ja Musa vanaa alevapuma Yelusalemu, alevikhongan'yaa panaa Yesu aleapwale. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Alevawawona vahemba vamoonga va Yesu vakholya endya kho mekhono yenaa ikhagombwa kho njela ja khokumbekha, kete venaa aleilomilwe kho njaanga ja Vayahudi.<verse eid="MRK 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Kho nguno Mafalisayo ne Vayahudi vensi alevakholoonda malaangi ganaa alevapokela khopuma kho vakoko jawe, evenee alevakhalijaga endya patokhola khokawala khopumana ne desituli ja khokumbekha Matuunda. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Khanke, panaa vakhotuuwa khopuma mwisokho, alevakhalijaga kento chechensi patokhola khokhawala mekhono, alevakholoonda njaanga jiinge kete venaa njela ya vakhosiinga vekhombe ne nyoongo ne ngegele ja shaba.<verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Apenee Mafalisayo ne valaangi va njaanga vamowolya Yesu, “Kho kee vahemba vakhoo akhavakholoonda mapokeelo ga vakoko visu, ila khopumana ne desituli ja khokumbekha Matuunda?”<verse eid="MRK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Yesu avawela, “Molevapepi! Isaya mokuuni wa Matuunda aleakunaa visoga khonguno yenyu, panaa aleandekha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:6">‘Vantu ewa vakhonkholya kho mpola topo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:6">ila momeoyo jawe, valekhotale nane.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Khonkumbekha khwawe khotopo chechensi, khonguno vakholiga njaanga jawe venee, jenaa onene alenkhavapela.’<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />“Onywenywe mokholekha njaanga ja Matuunda, ila mokholoonda njaanga ja vantu.”<verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Yesu aleendelela khovaweela, “Oywenywe motite njela nsoga yenaa ikhovanojaa khosiita njaanga ja Matuunda ili mowe mokholoonda malaangi genyu. <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Kho nguno njaanga ja Musa alejapalaa, ‘Motogagwe daada yakhoo no maye wakhoo’ no ‘muntu yeyensi yunaa khomotokha daada wakwe ao maye wakwe khopogiwaa khowolagwa.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Ila onywenywe mokholaanga ‘Mbe muntu atite kento kenaa nomopelaa daada yakwe ao maye wakwe,’ ‘Kento echoo a kolobani’ emaana yakwe a kento kho nguno ya komopumelya Matuunda, <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />gechoo mokhovanojaa vantu evoo vakhavalye valeli vawe. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Gechoo avyenee venaa mokhowocha olaala wa njaanga ja Matuunda khwa njela ya malaangi ganaa mwagapokelaga. Khanke, jepwale mpola nyinki jenaa mokhonojaa kete ejoo.”<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mpola jenaa jekhomonoja muntu akhagombwe khomokumbekha Matuunda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Mateo 15:10-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Apenee Yesu alealyetaa khanke idale la vantu, avawelaa, “Ntegeleli vensi ili mokhowole khomanya. <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Khotopo kento kenaa kekhomwingela muntu mokhate khopuma panji ne kenaa kekhomonoja muntu akhagombwe kho desituli ja khomokumbekha Matuunda. Ila kenaa kekhopuma mokhate mwa muntu achenee kekhomonoja muntu akhagombwe khomokumbekha Matuunda.” <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />Va matwi ga khotegeela ategeele!<verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Yesu ne vahemba vakwe panaa alevalelekha idale eloo la vantu no khwingela mokhate, vahemba vakwe alevamowolya avasonsomolele emaana ya mofwano ogoo. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Yesu avawelaa, “Mbi, ninga nanyu mokhamanya, kete kento kenaa kekhomwingela muntu mokhate khopuma panji, khotopo kemonoje muntu akhagombwe khomokumbekha Matuunda? <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Kho nguno kekhakekhomwingela momooyo, gechoo, kekhomwingela mondaa, apenee kekhwija kekhopuma panji ya mowele gwakwe.” Khwa khopaala gechoo, Yesu aleanojaa endya jensi jegoombwe khomokumbekha Matuunda.<verse eid="MRK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Apenee Yesu endelelaa khopaala, “Kenaa kekhopuma mokhate khwa muntu achenee kekhomonoja muntu akhagombwe khomokumbekha Matuunda. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Kho nguno momooyo gwa muntu gakhopuma maheewo mabe kete, osencha, wiwi, owolagi, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />wiketuu, wimi, obe, opepi, khotamanela nsawo, wiilu, ntoki, osiiti no oleele. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Obe wensi owo okhopuma momooyo gwa muntu, agenee gakhomonojaa muntu akhagombwe khomokumbekha Matuunda.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Khogoomba khwa mokhiima yomwi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Mateo 15:21-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Yesu aleawokhaa epoo no khopeta lwande ja pepi ihala la Tilo. Okhoo aleingelaa mo nyoomba yemwi yenaa aleakhaloma muntu yeyensi amanye, ila aleakhakhowola khiswekha. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Epoo mokhiima yomwi angile atite mwalele yunaa aleingelagwaa ne idemi, mokhiima oyoo panaa aleategelaa mpola ja Yesu, apaponye aleamotungamelaa pamegolo jakwe. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Kho nguno mokhiima oyoo angile nkha Moyahudi, ila omwene angile khopumelaa ihala la Foinike kho nse ya Silia. Amolombaa modugo Yesu amopumye mwalele wakwe idemi. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Ila Yesu aleamowela “Valekee vana vikhote taali, kho nguno nkha visoga khosola endya ya vana no khojejutela embwa.”<verse eid="MRK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Ila mokhiima oyoo aleamowela, “Odaada, ila ninga embwa jenaa jepwale panse ya meza jekholya masigelo ganaa alevakholya vana.”<verse eid="MRK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Yesu amowelaa mokhiima oyoo, “Kho nguno ya khogoomba khwakhoo, tuwaa khokhaye, kho nguno idemi lamopumaga mwalele wakhoo!”<verse eid="MRK 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Apenee mokhiima oyoo, aleapetaa khokhaye yakwe, amopikha mwalele wakwe agonagaa mo kegonelo, ne idemi alelamopumaga.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khomopony'a muntu yunaa angile kameme no velembaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Apenee Yesu aleawokhaa pepi ne lwande ja ihala la Tilo. Akelelaa Sidoni apikha Dekapoli emaana yakwe mahala ikomi, khokelela ilambo la Galilaya. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Epoo vantu alevamoletela Yesu muntu yomwi yunaa angile kameme no nkiwa, vamoloomba amotolele mokhono gwakwe muntu oyoo ili amopon'ye. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Yesu aleamokenkha muntu oyoo khompelo khonaa alekhotokhola vantu, amoketela lojala mo matwi, apenee atyela matye mo lojala no khopalyaa lolemi lwa muntu oyoo. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Apenee Yesu aleakunaa pachanya khwa Matuunda, aputelaa kho ngulu amowelaa, “Efata,” emaana yakwe “Digokhaa.”<verse eid="MRK 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Apaponye muntu oyoo andyaa khotegeela no lolemi lwakwe lwatungolwa, andyaa no khopaala.<verse eid="MRK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Yesu aleavawelaa vakhamowele muntu yeyensi mpola eyoo. Ila venaa alekhovagilya, avyenee alevakhwendelela khosambalyaa mpola ejoo. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Vantu vensi alevakhumya modugo, vandyaa khopaala, “Khonojaa gensi visoga, avaalaja velembaa khotegeela, ne makameme khopaala.”<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesu khovapelaa endya valyee vantu elufu jinee</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Mateo 15:32-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Kho nsiko ejoo idale lya vantu alelikhongan'ya khanke, ne alevatokhola endya, apenee Yesu aleavetaa vahemba vakwe avawelaa, <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />“Nkhovawonela losongo vantu ewa kho nguno vawaaga nane kho nsiko jetato ne vatokhola ninga endya. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Mbe mbaleke vapete khokhaye yawe ne njala valaagwa weesa monjela, kho nguno vamoonga vawe vapumaga khotale mudugo.” <verse eid="MRK 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Kho gechoo vahemba vakwe alevamowolya, “Epa khole khwipolu, mbi, akhopata khwenii mikate ja khovikhotya vantu vensi ewa?”<verse eid="MRK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Yesu avawolya, “Motite mikate jiinga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:5">Vamowela, “Khotite mikate saba.”<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Apenee avapogaa vantu vikhale panse. Asolaa eyoo mikate saba, amosongelaa Matuunda, amegan'yaa no khovapeela vahemba vakwe vawagawele vantu, nanevo vawagawela vantu. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Alevatite ne tonshe todoo todo vatiiti. Yesu amosongela Matuunda kho nguno ya nshe ejoo, avapelaa vahemba vakwe, vawagawele vantu. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Vantu alevalyaa no khwikota, apenee alevakhongan'yaa masigelo endya vijolya vikhapu saba. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Vantu vanaa alevalyaa angile kete vantu elufu jinee, apenee Yesu avadayaa vapetage, <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />nanoyo aleingela mwipogo palomwi ne vahemba vakwe, valowokha ilambo no khopeta lwande ja Dalimanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafalisayo vakhopooga lomekho</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">Mateo 16:1-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Okhoo, Mafalisayo vamoonga aleviija khwa Yesu no khwandyaa khomowolyaa Yesu. Ili vamogeme, alevamopooga anojee lomekho khopuma khochanya khwa Matuunda. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Yesu aleasayaa momooyo gwakwe no khwayola, apalaa, “Kho kee oleli owo okhopooga lomekho? Khapanga nkhovaweela oleli owo olalekha khopelwaa lomekho yeyensi.”<verse eid="MRK 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Apenee Yesu aleavalekhaa, atantaa khanke mwipogo no khwandya mosenjo gwa khopeta kho nkelo ya ilambo.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vahemba vakhokonya komomanya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Mateo 16:5-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Vahemba alevewagwaa khokepola mikate ya khokwelaa, alevatite mokate gomwi topo mwipogo. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Yesu avakhakelaa no khovaweela, “Mwiyangalelage ne malaangi ga Mafalisayo no Helode kete amila venaa kesasochaa otuu wa mikate.”<verse eid="MRK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Apenee vahemba vakwe alevandyaa khopalana venee kho venee, “Yesu khopalaa gechoo kho nguno khotokhola mikate ya khokweela.”<verse eid="MRK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Yesu aleatembolaa ganaa angile vakhopalana, avawolya, “Kho kee mokopalana kete motokhola mikate? Mbi, mokhale mommanye ninga khontembola? Mbi, masala genyu gakhale gadendagwa? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Mbi, motite miso ila mokhamokhowona? Motite matwi ila mokhamokhotegeela? Mbi, mokhakombokha? <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />Ituungo lenaa alenamegan'yaa mikate ejoo jitaano no khovapeela vantu elufu jetaano, mbi, masigelo ganaa alemwakhongan'yaa, alemwijolyaa vekhapu viinga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:19">Vamoweela, “Alekhwijolyaa vekhapu ikomi ne vewele.”<verse eid="MRK 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />“Ne panaa alenaimegan'ya mikate saba no khovapeela vantu elufu jinee, alemwakhongan'yaa vekhapu viinga vya masigelo ga endya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:20">Vamoweela, “Alekhwakhongan'yaa vekhapu saba.”<verse eid="MRK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Apenee avawolya, “Mbi, mokhale momanye kete onene ananuu?”<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khomopon'ya mtulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Yesu aleapikhaa Betisaida palomwi ne vahemba vakwe. Okhoo vantu alevamoletela mtulu, vamoloomba Yesu amopalye. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Apenee Yesu amowambaa mokhono mtulu oyoo, amopumya panji ya ihala. Yesu aleamotyela matye mo miso no khomotolela mekhono mo miso ga mtulu, amowolyaa, “Mbi, owine kento chechensi?”<verse eid="MRK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Mtulu oyoo akunaa, “Apalaa nkhovawona vantu, ila vakhwigela kete mapeke ganaa gakhogeenda.”<verse eid="MRK 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Apenee Yesu aleamotolelaa khanke mikhono mo miso. Apenee miso gakwe gadigokha ne ngulu jakwe ja khowona alejamotuwela, andyaa khowona vento vyensi visoga. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Apenee Yesu amodayaa, amowela apete khokhayakwe, apalaa, “Okhiije otuuwe khanke kho ihala!”<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo khomotembolaa Yesu amwene Kilisto</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Mateo 16:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luka 9:18-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Apenee Yesu ne vahemba vakwe alevendelela no mosenjo gwa khopeta kho mahala ga pepi ne Kaisalia Filipi. Panaa alevalemonjela, Yesu aleavawolya vahemba vakwe, “Mbi, vantu vakhopaala onene ananuu?”<verse eid="MRK 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Vamoweela, “Vaange vakhopala ogwegwe a Yohana Mubatiji, vaange vakhopaala Elia mokuuni wa Matuunda ne vaange vakhopaala yomwi wawe wa vakuuni va Matuunda.”<verse eid="MRK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Nanoyo avawolya, “Mbi, nanyu mokhopaala onene ananuu?” Petulo amowelaa, “Ogwegwe amwene Kilisto yunaa otomilwe no Matuunda.”<verse eid="MRK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Ila Yesu aleavagilyaa vakhiije vamowele muntu yeyensi mpola jakwe.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khopalelaa ncha no khofufokha khwakwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Mateo 16:21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luka 9:22-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Apenee Yesu aleandyaa khovaliga vahemba vakwe, “Mwana wa Muntu alakelela magayo minki no khositelwa ne valaala va Vayahudi ne valaala va vapumya matambekho va Matuunda ne valaangi va njaanga ja Musa ne lazima awolagwe, ila panaa nsiko jetato jelakela, alafufokha.” <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Yesu aleavawela mpola ejoo patokhola khovaswekha kento. Apenee Petulo amokhweselaa Yesu pampelo no khwandyaa khomokhakela. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Ila Yesu agalokhaa, avakunaa vahemba vakwe. Amokhakela Petulo apalaa, “Petaa khonyuma yaane Khatawe! Kho nguno okha khosiima ga Matuunda ila khosiima ga vantu.”<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Apenee Yesu alyetaa idale lya vantu palomwi ne vahemba vakwe, avawela, “Mbe muntu yeyensi khopogaa awee mohemba waane, khopogiwaa isite mwenee, itweke mosalaba gwakwe, andonde. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Kho nguno muntu yunaa khopogaa khopon'ya opanga wakwe mwenee, khaupwelya no muntu yunaa khopwelya opanga wakwe kho nguno yaane no kho nguno ja Mpola Nsoga ja Matuunda, khapony'a opanga gwakwe. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Mbi, muntu alapata chanuu, ninga mbe khapata nsawo jensi ja pa liwelelo, ila khawopwelya wome wakwe wa nsiko jensi? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Mbi, muntu nokhowolaa khogalolya wome wakwe ne kento kee? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Mbe, muntu yeyensi alambonela nsoni onene ne malaangi gaane, kho olelo owo, wonaa wiijolaga wiketuu ne mabe, nanoyo Mwana wa Muntu alamowonela nsoni, panaa alaawa ijilee palomwi ne Vatomami va pachanya pa Matuunda kho mong'alalo wa daada yakwe.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Yesu aleendelelaa khovaweela, “Khapanga nkovaweela, khole vantu vaange apapanye vanaa valalekha khocha panaa valaawa vakhale khowona wami wa Matuunda panaa olaawa wijile khwa ngulu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khogalokhaa no khong'alala kete lyonse</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Mateo 17:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luka 9:28-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Nsiko sita panaa alejakela, Yesu aleavasolaa Petulo no Yakhobo no Yohana apetaa nanevo mpakha kho ketonda ketale khonaa alevaleemwi topo. Okhoo, wigelo wakwe Yesu alewagalokha, <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />myenda jakwe alejang'alala jawa myelo modugo, ninga mokhanji yeyensi angile khotopo akhowole khojenoja jeng'alale gechoo. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Apenee vahemba vatato alevamowona Eliya no Musa vakhopaala no Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Petulo amowelaa Yesu, “Molaangi, amba visoga mbe osweswee khwikhale epa. Khogombelee khojeenge vidindiga vetato, kemwii amba chakhoo, kemwii cha Musa ne keenge amba cha Eliya.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Petulo aleapalaa gechoo, kho nguno omwene ne vahemba vayakwe alevingelwa no wowa kho nguno alevakhamanya la khopaala. <verse eid="MRK 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Apenee alelapumeela ilunde lavagubekha ne lolii lwategelekha khopuma mwilunde aleloo ekhopalaa, “Oyo amwene Mwanane yunaa mbotogilwe, motegelelaji!” <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Apaponye vahemba evoo alevakuuna kho lwande jensi, ila alevakhamowona muntu yuunge yunaa alepalomwi nanevo, ila Yesu aleemwi.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Panaa alevakhotelemokha pa ketonda, Yesu aleavagilyaa vakhiije vamowele muntu yeyensi mpola jenaa alevajiwona, mpakha panaa Mwana wa Muntu alafufokha khopuma khwa vachi.<verse eid="MRK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Vahemba evoo alevakhamowela muntu yeyensi kenaa alechanojekha kho ketonda, ila evenee alevakhopalana venee kho venee, Yesu aleatite emaana kee panaa alekhopalelaa khofwa no khofufokha khopuma khwa vachi. <verse eid="MRK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Apenee vahemba evoo alevamowolyaa Yesu, “Kho kee valaangi va njaanga ja Musa vakhopaala Eliya mukuuni wa Matuunda khopogiwa iije taali?”<verse eid="MRK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Yesu avawelaa, avyenee, “Eliya molooti wa Matuunda akhopogiwa iije taali, nanoyo amwenee alatula visoga mpola jensi. Ila kho kee seji, yandekhagwa kho Maandekho ga Matuunda, gakhopaala, Mwana wa Muntu alagaya vikhamu no khositwaa? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Ila nkovaweela, Eliya mokuuni wa Matuunda ijagaa, nanevo alevamonojelaa venaa alevakhopooga, kete venaa mandekho ga Matuunda venaa gakhopaala khomougela mwenee.”<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khomopony'aa mwana yunaa atite idemi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Mateo 17:14-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luka 9:37-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Panaa alevawapikhela vahemba evoo vaange, alevalewona idale ikolo la vantu epoo lavapilimaga. Valaangi vamoonga va njaanga ja Musa alevakhwiwolya nanevo. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Apaponye vantu evoo panaa alevamowona Yesu, alevakhumya modugo. Apenee alevamokembelela no khomolamochaa. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Yesu avawolyaa, “Alemokhwiwolya kee nanevo?”<verse eid="MRK 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Muntu yomwi pi idale eloo la vantu aleamowelaa, “Molaangi, namoletaga mwanane kwakhoo, atite idemi lenaa alelamonoja awee ne kameme. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Idemi eloo panaa lekhomwingela, lekhomogwishaa panse no khomonoja andye khopumwa ne ipulo momolomo no khoshaa mino no mowele gwakwe gokhokhala. Alenavalomba vahemba vakhoo vamopumyee idemi eloo, ila alevakhonya.”<verse eid="MRK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Yesu avawelaa, “Onywee olele wonaa mokhogoomba! Anikhala nanywi mpakha nalee? Ambankunelelya mpakha nalee? Moleeti molomyana oyoo khwaane.” <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Apenee alevamokenkha molomyana oyoo pa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:20">Idemi eloo panaa alelamowona Yesu, apaponye molomyana oyoo aleandya khotetema mudugo, gechoo aleagwaa panse no khwandya khobilingita no khopumwa ne ipulo momolomo. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Yesu amowolya daada yakwe no mwana oyoo, “Magayo ega gamwandajaa mpuma nale?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">Nanoyo amowelaa, “Aleandyaa geeke mpuma okeke wakwe. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Kho ituungo itale idemi alelekhomogwishela momoto no momeje, ili lemowolage. Gechoo, mbe nokhowolaa, khonoja kento khowonele losongo no khotwalya!”<verse eid="MRK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Yesu amowela, “Kho kee khopaala, mbe nokhowolaa? Mpola jensi jekhowolekha khwa muntu yunaa khogombaa.” <verse eid="MRK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Daada yakwe no molomyana oyoo aleajomaa no khopaala, “Nkhogoomba! Ila khogoomba khwane khokhakwela, nkholoomba onyalye.”<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Yesu panaa aleawona idale la vantu lekhongelekha nyango pa olongolo wakwe, alealekhakela idemi, “Ogwegwe idemi, yunaa wamonoja mwana oyoo akhakhowole khotegeela no khopaala, nkhonkoweela opume khwa mwana oyo ninga okhiije omwingele khanke!”<verse eid="MRK 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Apenee idemi eloo lakhowa madoolo, lamonoja molomyana oyoo ateteme mudogo, apenee Mwana oyoo aleapuma kete afwaga, ninga vantu vaange alevapaala, “Afwagaa.” <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Ila Yesu amowamba mokhono oyoo molomyana, amwalya khonyenyokha apenee amonyanyola no imelela.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Yesu panaa aleingela mo nyoomba, vahemba vakwe alevamowolya panaa alevalemwii, “Kho kee osweswe alekhwakhonya khomopumyaa idemi eloo?”<verse eid="MRK 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Yesu avawela, “Idemi la geeke khotopo lepume, ila topo khwa kholoomba.”<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khopalela khanke ncha yakwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:22">Mateo 17:22</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 17:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luka 9:43-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Yesu ne vahemba vakwe alevawookha epo, vakelela kho nse ya Galilaya. Ila Yesu aleakhatogwa vantu wamanye khonaa alevapwale, <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />kho nguno alekhovaliga vahemba vakwe. Aleavawela, “Mwana wa Muntu alagwelwa no khokenkwa khwa vantu vanaa valamowolaga, ila nsiko ya otato alafufokha.” <verse eid="MRK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Ila vahemba alevakhamanya kenaa alekhokunaa, nanevo alevingelwa no wowa khomowolya khowugela ncha yakwe.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ananuu yunaa atite olaala khokela vensi?</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mateo 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luka 9:46-48</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Panaa egoo alegakela Yesu palomwi ne vahemba vakwe alevapikha Kapelanaumu. Panaa alevingela mokhate ya nyoomba yenaa Yesu alekhwikha, Yesu avawolya, “Alemokhwisitela chanuu mo njela?” <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Ila vahemba vakwe alevapombula kho nguno alevakhwisitela ananuu yunaa atite olaala khokela vensi. <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Yesu ikhalaa panse, avakhongan'ya palomwi vahemba ikomi ne vawele, avawelaa, “Mbe muntu khopogaa awee wa olongolo amanyage khaawa panyuma ya vantu motomami wa vensi.” <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Apenee amosolaa mwana modo, amwimelekha pakhate yawe. Apenee amowawola no khovawela, <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />“Muntu yeyensi yunaa khomopokhela mwana kete oyo kho lina lyane, khaawa amopokelaga nenee, yunaa khompokela onenee, akhampokela onenee topo, ila khaawa amopokelagaa yunaa aleantoma.”<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muntu yunaa akhakhotopengelekhaa apwale palomwi naswi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 9:49">Luka 9:49</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 9:50">50</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Yohana amowela, “Molaangi, alekhwamowine muntu yomwi khopumya idemi kho lina lakho, naswi khwagema khomogilya kho nguno atapoya palomwi naswi.”<verse eid="MRK 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Ila Yesu apalaa, “Mokhamugilyee kho nguno khotopo muntu yeyensi yunaa khonoja otuntumu kho linaa lyane ne apaponye andye khopaala mabe pachanya yaane. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Kho nguno yunaa akhakhotopengelekhaa, apwale palomwi naswi. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Muntu yeyensi yunaa khavapela kekhombe cha meje ga khong'weela kho laane, kho nguno onywenywe mole vantu va Kilisto, khapanga alapelwa mfinga.”<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mpola jenaa jekhomonojaa muntu anojee mabe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Mateo 18:6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1">Luka 17:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:2">2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />Mbe muntu alamonoja yomwi wa vana evoo vanojee mabe, anga amba visoga mbe muntu oyo anga khatungelwa loala lwa khosheela monkingo yakwe no khojutelwaa mwilambo. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Mbe mokhono gwakhoo agokhokenkelya khonojaa mabe, owodomole. Kho nguno amba visoga khwingela no mokhono gomwii mo opanga nsiko jensi, khokela khowaa ne mekhono jewele no khwingela jehanamu mo moto gonaa gokhalimaga. <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />No omoo, magunyo gakhwe gakhafwaga no moto gwakwe gokhalimaga. <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Mbe, mogolo gwakhoo agokhokenkelya khonojaa mabe, owodomole. Kho nguno amba visoga khwingela no mogolo gomwii mo opanga wa nsiko jensi, khokela khowaa ne megolo jewele no khojutwa jehanamu mo moto gonaa gokhalimaga nsiko jensi. <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />No omoo, magunyo gakwe gakhafwaga no moto gwakwe gokhalimaga. <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Mbe liso lakho lemwii lekhokenkelye khonojaa mabe, lekumpolee. Kho nguno amba visoga khwingela mo wami wa Matuunda ne liso lemwii topo, khokela khowaa ne miso gawele no khojutwa jehanamu mo moto gonaa gokhalimaga kho nsiko jensi. <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />No omoo, magunyo gakwe gakhafwaga no moto gwakwe gokhalimaga.<verse eid="MRK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />“Matuunda alamokelelya kela muntu kho magayo ganaa gakhwipyana no moto kete vantu venaa vakhopakha molenge kho nyama panaa vakhowa vakhale khotuula mo moto.”<verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />Molenge a nsoga, ila mbe ipwelyee ononu wakwe, khotola kee ili etuvyee khanke ononu wakhwe?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:50">“Gechoo, ikhalagi no molenge mo meoyo jenyu no khwikhala visoga nywenywe kho nywenywe.”<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kholigaa pachanya ya wileki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Mateo 19:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luka 16:18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Yesu panaa aleawokhaa ne vahemba vakwe Kapelanaumu, alowokha nkelo ya lweje Yolodani vapetaa kho nse ya Yudea. Okhoo madale minki ga vantu alegikhongan'yaa khanke paolongolo wakwe, nanoyo avaligaa kete venaa angile kete venaa alekhanogaja.<verse eid="MRK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Apenee Mafalisayo alevamopetela no khomogema, vamowolya, “Mbi, njaanga ja Musa kegombaa mogwisha khomolekha molijakwe?” <verse eid="MRK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Yesu avawelaa, “Mbi, njaanga ya Musa alekepalaa mbi pachanya ya eloo?”<verse eid="MRK 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Nanevo vamowelaa, “Musa aleagombaa mogwisha khomwandekela talatasi molijakwe ya khwilekha.”<verse eid="MRK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Yesu avawelaa, “Musa aleavandekela njaanga eyoo kho nguno ya okhaku wa meoyo jenyu. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Ila mpuma khowombwa kho liwelelo, ‘Matuunda aleamowomba mogwisha palomwi no mokhiima.’ <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />Gechoo mogwisha alamoleka daada yakwe no maye wakwe, nanoyo alaawa palomwi no molijakwe, <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />ne ewa vawele valaawa mowele gomwii. Gechoo, ewa valaawa nkha vawele khanke, ila muntu yomwii. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Gechoo, kenaa alechasanjwa no Matuunda, khotopo muntu khokelegonkhan'yaa.”<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Panaa alevingela khanke mo nyuumba, vahemba vakhwe alevamowolyaa Yesu pachanya ya mpola eyoo. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Yesu avawelaa, “Yunaa khomolekha molijakwe no khotoola yoonge, khaawa khonojaa osencha khwa khotolekha khapanga kwa molijakwe. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />No mokhiima yunaa khomolekhaa mogwisha no khotoolwa no yoonge, nanoyo khaawa khonojaa osencha.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khovalombela vana vado</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mateo 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luka 18:15-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Vantu angile vakhomoletela Yesu vana vado avatolelee mikhono ili Matuunda avanojele masoga, ila vahemba vakwe alevawakhakela vantu evoo. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Yesu panaa aleawona gechoo, aleasimbaa no khovawelaa, “Valekhagi vana vado viije khwaane ne mokhavagilyee, kho nguno wami wa Matuunda olepwale kho nguno ya vantu vanaa vapwale kete vana ewa. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Khapanga nkhovawela, muntu yeyensi yunaa akhakhopokela wami wa Matuunda kete mwana modo, khotopo iije ingele omoo.” <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Apenee Yesu aleavasola vana no khovawawola avatolela mekhono yakwe pachanya ya mitwe jawe, ili Matuunda avanojele masoga.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musawi yunaa alekhotamanela wome wa nsiko jensi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mateo 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luka 18:18-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Yesu panaa alekhowokhaa, muntu yomwi aleamokembela lowelo, amotungamela, amowolya, “Molaangi mosoga, nojee mbi ili nane nkhowole khopokela opanga wa nsiko jensi?”<verse eid="MRK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Yesu amowela, “Mbi nkonyeeta mosoga?” Khotopo yunaa mosoga, ila topo Matuunda alemwii. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Aleendelela khomoweela, ojemanjile njaanga ja Matuunda, “Okhawolage, okhanoje osencha, okhiiwe, okhapale opepi, okhapepe, vatogagwe daada yakhoo no maye wakhoo.”<verse eid="MRK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Muntu oyoo amowela Yesu, “Molaangi, njaanga jensi najevambaga mpuma olomyana waane.” <verse eid="MRK 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Yesu aleamokunaa no khomotogwaa, ila amowelaa, “Wapongokelagwa ne kento kemwi topo. Petaa ogolyee vento vyensi venaa otite ne mpia ejoo ovapelee vapeena, nagwe amba witolelaja pachanya pa Matuunda, epoo apenee wiije ondonde.” <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Muntu oyoo panaa aleategela egoo, aleasayaa, awokhaa oko khosayaa, kho nguno aleatite nsawo nyinki. <verse eid="MRK 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Yesu aleakunaa kho lwande jensi, avawela vahemba vakwe, “Amba vikhamu modugo vanaa vatite nsawo khwingela kho wami wa Matuunda!” <verse eid="MRK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Vahemba vakwe alevakhumya modugo kho mpola jakwe, ila Yesu aleavawela khanke, “Vanaane, kunaa venaa vikhamu kho vanaa vatite nsawo khwingela mo wami wa Matuunda! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />A vipelu kho ndimwana yunaa khwetwaa ngamia khokelela mwidoli la shindano, khokela muntu yunaa atite nsawo khwingela mo wami wa Matuunda.” <verse eid="MRK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Vahemba vakwe alevakhumya modugo no khwandya khwiwolya venee kho venee, “Gechoo, ananuu yunaa alanokolwa?”<verse eid="MRK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Yesu avadololela miso avawela, “Mpola eye khwa vantu ikhakhowolekha, ila khwa Matuunda gensi gakhokhowolekha.”<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Petulo amowelaa, “Kunaa, khwalekhaga vento vyensi khwakholondaga ogwegwe.”<verse eid="MRK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Yesu apalaa, “Khapanga nkhovawela, muntu yeyensi yunaa khalekha nyuumba ao vadogo va kegwisha ao vadogo va kekhiima ao maye ao daada yakwe ao vana ao megoonda kho nguno yaane no kho nguno ya Mpola Nsoga, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />alapokela mala igana kho ituungo ele la seji. Alapokela nyoomba ao vadogo va kegwisha ao vadogo va kekhiima ao maye ao vana ao megoonda khanke valagaya no kho ituungo lenaa liijile valapokela wome wa nsiko jensi. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Vamwandyo valaawa wa vamodugo ne vamodugo valaawa va mwandyo.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khopalela kho mala ya otato ncha yakwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mateo 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luka 18:31-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Yesu ne vahemba vakwe angile vapwale mo njela khopeta Yelusalehemu. Yesu alekhovalongola vahemba vakwe, vahemba alevakhumya ila vantu vanaa alevakhovaloonda alevogopa. Yesu avasolaa khanke evoo vahemba vakwe ikomi ne vawele avakenkha khompelo, andyaa khovaweela ganaa agamopumela. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />Yesu avawelaa, “Tegelelii! Khopetile Yelusalemu, no okhoo Mwana wa Muntu alalekhwa kho vapumya matambekho valaala ne valaangi va njaanga ja Musa. Vamositacha no khomokenkha kho vantu vanaa nkha Vayahudi, nanevo valamotengemekha awolagwe, <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />nanewo valamobyeeda Yesu, valamotyela matye, valamofwemba ne menyepo ja ntila, apenee valamowolaga. Ila nsiko ya otato alafufokha.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakhobo no Yohana vakholoomba olaala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Mateo 20:20-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Apenee Yakhobo no Yohana vana va zebedayo, aleviija khwakwe no khomowelaa, “Molaangi, khokhopooga okhonojele kento kenaa akhokholomba.”<verse eid="MRK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Yesu avawolyaa, “Mokhopooga mbanojele chanuu?”<verse eid="MRK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Vamoweela, “Khogombelee khwikhale nagwee, yomwi kho lwande gwakhoo wa mukege no yoonge mo lwande wa molyelo panaa olaikhala pa kegoda chakhoo cha wami wakhoo olaala.”<verse eid="MRK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Ila Yesu avawelaa, “Onywenywee mokhamanya kento kenaa mokholomba. Mbi, amokhowola khogaya kete venaa ndiija ngaye onene? Mbi amokhowola khowolagwa kete venaa ndiija mbolagwe onene?”<verse eid="MRK 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Vamowela, “Akhokhowola.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:39">Yesu avawelaa, “Khapanga molakhowola, magayo ganaa ndiija ngaye ne ncha yenaa ndawolagwa ayenee nanyu molawolagwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Ila onene ntokhola olaala wa khosagola ananuu alikhala pa mokhono gwane gwa molyelo ao gwa mukege. Matuunda mwenee amwenee yunaa amanyile ananuu alikhala kho lwande lwa molyelo ne mukege kho evoo vanaa aleavasagolaga.”<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Evoo vahemba vaange ikomi panaa alevategela egoo, alevandyaa khovakilwaa Yakhobo no Yohana. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Gechoo, Yesu avetaa, avawela, “Momanyile kete evoo vanaa vakhohewelwa kete vami va liwelelo vakhovimelela vantu vawe kho ngulu, ne valaala evoo vakhowa pachanya ya vantu vawe. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Ila khwenyu ekhawe gechoo, ila omwene yunaa khopogaa awee molalaa pakhate yenyu, kholomwaa awee motomami wenyu. <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />Muntu yeyensi yunaa khopogaa khovalongolya vaange, awee motomami wa vensi. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Kho nguno ninga Mwana wa Muntu angile akhiija kho liwelelo ili vantu vamotomekele, ila khovatomekela vantu no khopumya wome wakwe ili khovakhombola vantu.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khomopon'ya Batimayo yunaa angile mtuluu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mateo 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luka 18:35-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Apenee vapikha Yeliko. Yesu panaa alekhowokhaa ne vahemba vakwe kho nse eyoo palomwii ne idale ikolo la vantu, alevamopikha muntu yomwi mtuluu lina lakwe Batimayo Mwana wa Timayo, aleikhalagaa pampelo ne njela, kholombalombaa. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Panaa aleategela kete a Yesu wa kho Nazaleti amwenee alekhokela epoo, Batimayo aleandyaa khopaala kho lolii nkolo, “Yesu Mwana wa Daudi, mbonelee losongo.”<verse eid="MRK 10:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Vantu vinki alevamokhakela ili apombule. Ila omwenee aleakelelya khopaala kho lolii nkolo, “Mwana wa Daudi mbonele losongo.”<verse eid="MRK 10:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Yesu aleimelela, apalaa, “Momwete.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:49">Apenee vamweta mtuluu oyoo, vamowela, “Ipelee mooyo, imelelaa, Yesu khokhwetaa.”<verse eid="MRK 10:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Nanoyo aleajutaa mwenda gwakwe khotale, Batimayo imelelaa nyango, amopetelaa Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 10:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Yesu amowolya, “Khopogaa nkhonojele chanuu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:51">Mtuluu oyoo amowela, “Molaangi, nkhopooga nkhowole khowona.”<verse eid="MRK 10:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Yesu amowelaa, “Petaa khokhaye, kho nguno khogoomba khwako khwakhopon'yajaa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:52">Apaponye mtuluu oyoo, andyaa khowona, amolondaa Yesu monjela.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s">Yesu khopokelwa Yelusalemu khwa nsekho ne ngilingili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mateo 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohana 12:12-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Yesu ne vahemba vakwe, panaa vakhotelela Yelusalemu alevapikha kho ihala la Betifage ne Betaniya pepi ne ketonda cha Mizeituni. Epoo Yesu aleavatomaa vahemba vakwe vawele vamolongole, <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />avawelaa, “Petagi kho ihala lenaa lepwale paolongolo wenyu. Molamopikha mwana ndogowe, yunaa akhaale khonojaa molemo gwegwensi, atungagwaa. Momotungule no khomoleeta khwaane. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Mbe muntu yeyensi khavawolya, ‘Kho kee mokhomotungola?’ Momowele, ‘Odaada khomopogaa ne khomotuvya kho ituungo ikupee lenaa lijile.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Apenee, vapetaa, vamopikha mwana ndogowe atungagwa pampelo ya njela pepi ne molyango wa nyoomba. Panaa alevakhomotungola, <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />vantu vamoonga vanaa alevimelelaga epoo vawawolya, “Kho kee mokhomotungola oyoo mwana ndogowe?”<verse eid="MRK 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Ne evoo vahemba vawaweela kete venaa Yesu aleavawelaa, nanevo alevawagombela vapete no mwana ndogowe. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Apenee vahemba evoo, alevamokenkela Yesu mwana ndogowe oyoo, vaala myenda jawe pachanya ya mwana ndogowe no Yesu ikhala pachanya yakwe. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Vantu vinki vaala myenda jawe mo njela, vaange Vatandalyaa matambe ga mapekhe ganaa alevagadomolaga momegonda. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Vantu vensi vanaa alevalongola ne vanaa angile vapwale khonyuma, alevakhojoma no khopaala, “Akholiwe Matuunda. <verse eid="MRK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Onojelwee masoga wami wonaa wijile wa Odaada wisu Daudi. Akholiwee Matuunda yunaa alekhochanya modugo!”<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Yesu aleingelaa kho nse ya Yelusalemu aleapeta aviyoo mpakha kho nyoomba ya Matuunda, aleakunaa vento vyensi kho wangalelo mosoga. Kho nguno angile mesee, aleapetaa Betania palomwii ne vahemba vakwe ikomi ne vawele.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kholegetaa ipeke la mtini</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:18">Mateo 21:18</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 21:19">19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Igolo lakwe panaa alevakhopuma Betania, Yesu aleatite njala. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Panaa alewonaa ipeke la mtini khwa otale lenaa angile letite matiti minki. Awopetela ili awokune mbe aleotite viligi vyevyensi. Panaa aleaupekila, awopikilee otite matiti topu otokhola viligi, kho nguno angile nkha ituungo la cha viligi. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Yesu angile alewelaa ipeke eloo, “Khwandelya leelo ne nsiko jensi muntu yeyensi akhiije alyee viligi vyakhoo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:14">Nanevo vahemba vakwe alevamotegeela khopalaa gechoo.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khopetaa kho nyoomba ya Matuunda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mateo 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luka 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohana 2:13-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Panaa alevapikha Yelusalemu. Yesu aleingelaa kho nyoomba ya Matuunda avadagaa vanaa alevakhogolya no khogola vento epoo. Ajependolaa emeza ja vantu vanaa alevakhogalolya mpia, apendula ne vete vya vantu vanaa angile vakhogolya njewa. <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />Aleakhamoloma muntu yeyensi asole kento khopuma kho lwande ja nyoomba ya Matuunda. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Apenee avaligaa vantu, khwa khopaala, “Yandekhagwa kho mandekho ga Matuunda, ‘Nyoomba yaane eleetwa nyoomba ya khonojela maloombi kho nguno ya nse jensi’ Ila onywenywe mwainogaja khowa lwande ya vasuki.”<verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Vapumya matambekho valaala va Matuunda ne valaangi va njaanga panaa alevategeela egoo, alevandyaa khopooga njela ya khomowulaga. Ila alevamwogopa kho nguno idale lensi la vantu alevakhumyaa khwa malaangi gakwe masoga. <verse eid="MRK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Panaa aleyapikha mesee, Yesu palomwi ne vahemba vakwe alevapuma kho ihala eloo.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilaangi kowugela ipeke la mtini wonaa wanyalaga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Mateo 21:20-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Igolo lakwe melaawo, panaa alevakhokela alevagowona motini gwakhalaga khopuma kho matambe mpakha kho milii yakwe. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Petulo aleakhombolaa mpola ejoo jenaa Yesu aleapalaa kowogela owoo mtini, apenee amowelaa, “Molaangi, kunaa! Ipeke eloo la mtini wonaa alewagolegeta gwakhalaga.” <verse eid="MRK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Yesu avawela, “Momogombage Matuunda. <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Khapanga nkhovawela, mbe muntu khakewela ketonda eke, ‘Limbokhaa wisombele mo ikhwa,’ no okhawe no wowa momooyo gwakhoo kho echoo kenaa khopalaa, ila agoombe kete mpola jensi jenaa khopalaa gakhonojekha, khanojelwa mpola eyoo. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Kho gechoo nkovaweela, chechensi kenaa mokhopogaa khwa khomoloomba Matuunda, gombagi kete mwapokelaga ne kelaawa chenyu. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Panaa amba mokholoomba, movasamehi vensi vanaa alevawanojela mabe, ili Daada yenyu wa pachanya khotopo avasamehi nanywi mabe genyu.” <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />Ila mbe amosita khovasamehi vaange, Daada yenyu yunaa apwale pachanya khotopo avasamehi nanywi mabe genyu.<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khowolwa khougela wami wakwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mateo 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luka 20:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Apenee, Yesu ne vahemba alevapikha khanke Yelusalemu. Panaa angile khogendaa kho nyoomba ya Matuunda, vapumya matambekho valaala, valaangi va njaanga ne vakhoombi alevamopetela, <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />vamowolya, “Khonojaa mpola eje kho olaala wa ananuu? Ananuu yunaa aleakhopelaa olaala wa khonojaa mpola eje?”<verse eid="MRK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Yesu avawelaa, Ambawolya mpola yemwi, mbe mombwele, nane ambawela nkhonojaa mpola eje kho olaala kee. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Mbwelagi, olaala wa Yohana wa khobatija alegapuma khwa Matuunda ao khwa vantu?<verse eid="MRK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Apenee, vandya khopalana venee kho venee, vapaala, “Mbe, khopaale, ‘Alegapuma khwa Matuunda’, khatowolya, ‘Kho kee alemokhamogomba Yohana?’ <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Avivyoo mbe khopaale, ‘Alegapuma khwa vantu.’ ” Valevogopa idale la vantu, kho nguno vensi alevakhomogoomba Yohana angile molooti wa Matuunda. <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Apenee, vamoweela Yesu, “Osweswee khokhamanya.” Nanuyo Yesu avawelaa, “Nane khotopo mmbawele nkhonojaa mpola eje kho olaala kee.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s">Mofwano gwa mogoonda gwa mizabibu ne valemi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mateo 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luka 20:9-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Yesu aleandya khopaala nanevo kho mefwano apalaa, “Muntu yomwi alealemaa mogonda gwa mizabibu. Alepilimya logelele, ne pakhate yakhwe asembaa isima lya khonogelelya divai, ajengaa no kedindiga cha kholindelelya. Akhodishilye mogoonda ogoo kho valemi, apenee apetaa kho nse ya khotale. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Ituungo la khokongola panaa alelapikha, aleamotoma motomami wakwe apete kho valemi evoo, ili apete amosolele viligi vemoonga vya zabibu. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Ila valemi evoo alevamogweela no khomokowa motomami oyoo, alevamodaga patokhola khomopeela viligi vyevyensi. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Apenee muntu wa mogonda aleamotoma motomami yoonge apete khanke, oyoo nanuyo valemi alevamokowa khwiitwe no khomonojela mpola ja nsoni. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Ila oyoo wa mogoonda aleamotoma khanke motomami yoonge, oyoo alevamowolaga. Epo apenee aleatoma vatomami vaange vinki, vamoonga va valemi alevawakowa ne vaange alevawawolaga. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Owamogonda aleasigelagwa no muntu yomwi topo wa khomotoma, oyoo angile mwanakwe yunaa amotogwilee. Apenee amotomaa no khopaala, ‘Amo avamokholya mwanane.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Ila panaa aleapikhaa, valemi evoo alevapalana venee kho venee, khwa khopalaa, ‘Oyo amwene mosaali, lekhaa khomowolage ne osaali wakwe olaawa wisu!’ <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Apenee vamogweela, vamowolaga no khomosutya panji no mogoonda ogoo gwa mizabibu.<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />“Mokhoheewa muntu owa mogoonda khanoja kee? Aliija no khovawolaga valemi evoo ne khovakhodiselya vantu vaange mogoonda ogoo gwa mozabibu. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Mbi, mokhasoma maandekho ega?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10">‘Ibwe lenaa alevasiita vajeengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10">seji lawaaga ibwe ikolo la mosingi.<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Odaada Matuunda amwene anogajaa mpola eye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:11">nanelo la otuntumu modugo khwisu!’ ”<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Apenee, vapumya matambekho valaala va Matuunda ne valaangi va njaanga ne vakhoombi, alevamanya kete mofwano ogoo aleokhovaloma. Kho nguno angile vagema khomogweela, ila alevatungumala winki wa vantu. Apenee alevamolekha vawookha.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kholepa khodi khwa Kaisali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mateo 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luka 20:20-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Panaa ituungo alelakela, valaala va Vayahudi alevawatoma vamoonga wa Mafalisayo ne vantu va idale la Helode, alevamoteeya ili vamogwele kho mpola jakwe mwenee. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Vamopetela Yesu, vamowelaa, “Molaangi, khomanyile kete ogwegwe a muntu mosoga yunaa khopalaa khapanga topo, ninga okhakhomotungumala muntu yeyensi. Kho nguno okhakunaa olaala wa muntu, okholiga ganaa Matuunda khogapogaa. Mbi a njaanga khomolepa Kaisali khodi? Ao nkha gechoo, mbi, kholepe ao khokhalepe?”<verse eid="MRK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Ila Yesu aleamanya obe wonaa alevakunelelya, avawelaa, “Kho kee mokhonteeya? Nndeteli mpia ya kechele ya dinali mbone.”<verse eid="MRK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Vamoletela eyoo mpia ya kechele ya dinali. Yesu avawolya, “Osho owo wa muntu yenaa ipwale kho mpia eye ne maandekho ega ga nanuu?” Nanevo vamowelaa, “A ya Kaisali mwami mokolo wa Loma.”<verse eid="MRK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Apenee Yesu avawelaa, “Mopeli Kaisali mwami mokolo wa Loma ganaa gakwe ne ga momopele Matuunda ganaa gakwe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:17">“Alevakumyaa modugo venaa Yesu aleinasolaa pa moteyo gwawe.”<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mpola ya khofufokha khopuma khwa vachi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mateo 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luka 20:27-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Apenee idale la Vayahudi lenaa lekhwetwaa Masadukayo, vanaa vakhopaala khotopo khofufokha khopuma khwa vachi, vamopetela Yesu no khomowolya, <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />vapaala, “Molaangi, Musa aleatwandekela khowa muntu mbe achee no khomolekha mokhiima atokhola mwana, modogwakwe amosole mosimbe oyoo, ili amolelele modogwakwe vana. <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Seji angile vapwale vadogo saba. Wa mwandyo aleatola, afwaa patokhola kholekha mwana. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Apenee modogwakwe wa owele aleasalaa mosimbe oyoo, ila nanuyo afwaa patokhola kholekha mwana. Yaawa avivyoo no kho modogwakwe wa otato. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Khotopo ninga yomwi kho vantu evoo saba yunaa alelekha mwana. Mudugo, mokhiima oyoo nanuyo aleafwaa. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Seji khowelee, nsiko yenaa vantu valafufokha, mokhiima oyoo khaawa mokhiima wa ananuu? Kho nguno vensi saba alevikhala nanuyo kete moliji.”<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Yesu avawelaa, “Onywenywe mwanonaga, kho nguno mokhamanya maandekho ga Matuunda ninga olaala wa Matuunda. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Kho nguno vachi panaa valafufokha khotopo viije vatoole ninga khotoolwa, valaawa kete vatomami va khochanya pa Matuunda. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Ila khougela vantu khofufolwa, mbi, mokhasoma kho ketabu cha Musa kete Matuunda venaa alekhopalaa no Musa kho kesakha kenaa angile kekhopya moto? Matuunda aleamowela Musa, ‘Onene ne Matuunda wa Abulahamu, Matuunda wa Isaka no Matuunda wa Yakhobo.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Matuunda nkha Matuunda wa vachi, ila a Matuunda wa vantu vanaa wome. Onywenywe mwanonaga modugo.”<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Njaanga nkolo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Mateo 22:34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luka 10:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Molaangi yomwi wa njaanga aleapikha no khovategeela vakhopalana. Panaa aleamanya kete Yesu alevawela visoga, ipumelya, amowolya, “Kho njaanga jensi, elenkhwee yenaa njaanga nkolo?”<verse eid="MRK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Yesu apalaa, “Njaanga yenaa nkolo ayenee eye, ‘Tegeleli onywenywe vantu va Izilaeli! Odaada Matuunda wisu, amwene Odaada aleemwi. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Motogagwee Odaada Matuunda wakhoo kho mooyo gwakhoo gwensi, kho moye gwakhoo gwensi, kho masala gakhoo gensi no kho ngulu jakhoo jensi.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Ne njaanga ya owele ayenee eye, ‘Motogagwee wa pepi wakho kete venaa witogwile ogwegwe.’ Khotopo njaanga yeenge yenaa nkolo khokela eje.” <verse eid="MRK 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Oyoo molaangi wa njaanga amowela, “Molaangi! Wapalaga visoga kete Matuunda a yomwi topo ninga khotopo yoonge ila mwenee. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Mpola eye a nsoga, khomotogwa Matuunda kho mooyo gwensi, kho masala gensi ne kho ngulu jensi ne khomotogwa wa pepi wakwe kete venaa witogwile mwenee. A visoga khomopumelya Matuunda sadakha ja matambekho ya khotimwa ne ja matambekho gensi.”<verse eid="MRK 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Yesu panaa aleawona muntu oyoo, aleamowela khwa omanyi, amowela, “Ogwegwe ole pepi ne wami wa Matuunda.” Khwandelya epoo, khotopo muntu yunaa aleagemaa khomowolya khanke mpola jejensi.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kilisto yunaa aleasagolwa no Matuunda a mwana wa nanuu?</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mateo 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luka 20:41-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Ituungo panaa Yesu angile kholigaa kho nyoomba Matuunda, aleavawolya, “Mbi valaangi va njaanga, vakhopaala kete Kilisto a Mwana wa mwami Daudi? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Kho nguno Daudi mwenee khwa khongolwaa no Moye wa Matuunda, aleapalaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">‘Mwene Matuunda waane, ikhalaa kho lwande lwaane lwa molyelo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">Mpakha panaa ndavatula vanyambuda vakhoo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">panse ya megolo jakhoo.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Mbe Daudi mwenee khomwetaa ‘Mwene.’ Kho gechoo khakhowola Kilisto awe Mwanakwe?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 12:37">Yesu khovawela vantu vikhale miso ne valaangi va njaanga ja Musa</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 12:37">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mateo 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luka 20:45-47</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Idale la vantu alevakhomotegelelya Yesu kho nsekho. <verse eid="MRK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Yesu kho malaangi gakwe, aleapalaa, “Ikhalagi miso ne valaangi va njaanga ja Musa, evenee vatogwile khogenda oko valyalaga myenda metale nokhotogwa kholamochwa khwa khokoliwa kho lwande jenaa vantu vakhwikhongan'yaa, <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />ne panaa vakhopeta kho nyoomba ya khwitangela Vayahudi, angile vakhotogwa khwikala vegoda vya valaala, no kho lwande ja khokoliwa kho weenga. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Vakhovakhosha kosha vasimbe no khosola nsawo vyawe, ne ili viigele vasoga, vakholoomba malombi matale. Vantu ewa valapelwa matengemekho makolo.”<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sadakha ya mokhiima mosimbe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luka 21:1-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Yesu aleikhalaga khwa khukunana ne sandekho la witolelya sadakha. Awaa khokunaa venaa vantu vinki vakhopumya nsawo ne khojetola kho isandekho eloo. Vasawi vinki alevakhopumya mpia nyinki. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Epoo aleiija mokhiima yomwi mosimbe yunaa mopeena, aleapumyaa mpia jewele ja kechele ja shaba jenaa alejekhakhwela khogolela vento vesoga. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Epoo Yesu avetaa vahemba vakwe, avawela, “Khapanga nkovawelaa, mokhiima oyoo mosimbe yunaa mopeena amwene yunaa apumaja sadakha yenaa nkolo khokela vantu vensi. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Kho nguno vaange vensi alevapumya masigilo ga nsawo jawe, ila mokhiima oyoo mosimbe ninga venaa mopeena apumya vyensi venaa aleatite ninga kenaa khosololela kho nguno ya opanga wakwe.”<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s">Yesu khopalaa khougela khonoonwa khwa nyoomba ya Matuunda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mateo 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luka 21:5-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Yesu panaa angile khopuma kho nyoomba ya Matuunda, yomwi wa vahemba vakwe aleamowela, “Molaangi, khuuna venaa mabwe ega ne majeengo ega masoga!”<verse eid="MRK 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Yesu amowela, “Ogawine majeengo ega venaa makolo? Khotopo ninga ibwee lemwi lenaa lelasiga pachanya ya leenge, kela kento kelabomolwa.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Magayo no khogaya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mateo 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luka 21:7-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Yesu panaa angile ikhalaga pachanya ya ketonda wa Mizeituni, wonaa okhokunana ne nyoomba ya Matuunda, epoo Petulo no Yakhobo no Yohana no Andelea, alevamopetela panaa alepatokhola vantu vamowolya, <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />“Khokholoomba okhowele, mpola eje jelapumela nale? Chanuu kelalagela mbe mpola eje jele pepi khopumela?”<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Yesu avawela, “Mwikhalage miso mokhije mopepelwee no muntu. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Kho nguno vantu vinki valija khokelela lina lyane, kela muntu alapala onenee amwene Kilisto! Nanevo valawapepela vantu vinki. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Panaa molategela mpola ja wolugo ne lokumo ja wolugo, mokhatungumale. Mpola eje jekhopogiwa khopumeela, ila eloo idugo amba lekhale. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Nse yemwi ilaawa ikhwikowa ne nse yeenge, no wami womwi olaikhowa ne wami woonge, kholaawa ne matitimya oko no okhoo ne njala nkolo. Owo awenee olaawa mwandyo wa osaati kete venaa mokhiima yunaa alepepi khwitungula mwana.”<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />“Ila nywenywe mwikhalage miso. Kho nguno valawagwela no khovakenkha kho mavanza la valaala no khovafwemba menyepo ja ntila kho nyoomba ya khwitangela Vayahudi. Molatengemekhwa paolongolo ya valaala ne vami kho nguno yaane, ili movawele Mpola Nsoga. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Naneyo Mpola Nsoga a lazima iteengwe kho vantu va nse jensi panaa amba odugo owoo okhale opike. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Panaa molagwelwa no khositachwa, mokhatungumale chanuu molapalaa, ila palagi lelensi lenaa molapelwa khwi ituungo eloo, kho nguno nkha nywenywe vanaa molapalaa, ila a Moye wa Matuunda yunaa apwale mokhate yenyu amwene yunaa alavapalela. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Modogo khamogalokha modogoakwee ili afwe no daada alamogalokha mwanakwe no mwana nanoyo alavasita valeli vawe no khokenkelelya vawolagwe. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Vantu vensi valavasimbila nywenywe kho nguno ya lina laane. Ila yunaa aliikhamelelya mpakha paudugo, amwene alaawa mome.<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Magayo makolo ganaa giijile</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Mateo 24:15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luka 21:20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />“Panaa molawona kento kenaa ‘Kekhosimbya’ kepwale kho lwande yenaa ekhalomwa ewee, nanecho kekhovanoja vawookhe kho nyoomba ya Matuunda, “Apenee evoo vanaa vapwale kho nse ya Yudea vakembelele kho ketonda, yunaa khosomaa amanye. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />Yunaa apwale pachanya ya nyoomba akhiije atelemoke khwingela mokhate mwakwe no khosola kento chechensi. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Yunaa amba apwale kho mogoonda akhiije atuuwe khokhaye khosola mwenda gwakwe. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Amba khole magayo makolo kho vakhiima vanaa amba vatite ndaa na vanaa amba vakhoncha nsiko ejoo. <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Lombagi ili mpola ejoo jekiije jepumele nsiko ja mpepo. <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Kho nguno nsiko ejoo kholaawa ne magayo ganaa gakhale khopumela, mpuma mwandyo panaa Matuunda aleawomba liwelelo, mpakha seji ninga khotopo gapumeele khanke. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Mbe Odaada anga akhapongolye nsiko ejoo, khotopo muntu yunaa alasiga mopanga. Ila Odaada apongolaja ituungo eloo kho nguno ya evoo vanaa aleavasagulaga.<verse eid="MRK 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />“Mbe muntu avawele, ‘Kunaa, Kilisto apwale epa,’ ao, ‘Apwale epoo’ mokhamogombele. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Kho nguno valapumela vantu vanaa vakhwiyeeta Kilisto ne vakuuni va opepi, valanoja lomekho ne matuntumu, no khovapepela vantu vanaa vasagolagwaa no Matuunda. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Gechoo, mwikhalage miso. Navawelaga mpola jensi ejoo jenaa jekhale khopumeela.<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Khwija khwa Mwana wa Muntu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mateo 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luka 21:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />“Ila nsiko ejoo, panaa ituungo la magayo khokela, lyonse lelatulwa kitii no mweli khotopo khwangalya. <verse eid="MRK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />Njota jelagwaa khopuma pachanya pa ilunde, ne ngulu ja khochanya khwa Matuunda jeladegadega.”<verse eid="MRK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />Apenee vantu vensi valamowona Mwana wa Muntu khotelomokha mwilunde oko atite ngulu nyinki no khong'alala kho olaala wa Matuunda. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Apenee khavalagelelya vatomami va pachanya pa Matuunda vavakhongan'ye evoo vanaa avasagola khopuma lwande jensi jinee ja liwelelo, khopuma pa udugo wa liwelelo mpakha kho udugo wa khochanya pa Matuunda.<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mofwano gwa ipeke la mtini</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mateo 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luka 21:29-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />“Ila mwiilige khokelela ipekhe lya mtini. Panaa matambe gakwe gakwandya khofuluma ne khopumya matiti, apenee mokhomanya kete ituungo la khotonya mbula latelelaga. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Avivyoo, nanywi panaa moliija mowone egoo gakhopumelaga, momanyage kete Mwana wa Muntu alepamolyaango. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Khapanga nkovawela, olelo ogo khotopo khokela mpakha panaa mpola jensi jepumeele. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Pachanya kho Matuunda ne liwelelo jelakela, ila mpola jaane khotopo jekele.<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Khotopo yunaa amanyile nsiko ya khwija Mwana wa Muntu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Mateo 24:36-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />“Khwa mpola ya nsiko eyoo ne ituungo, khotopo yeyensi yunaa amanyile, ninga vatomami va pachanya khwa Matuunda, ninga Mwana, ila Odaada aleemwi. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Mwikhalage miso no khwiyandelela kho nguno mokhamanya ituungo eloo lelaawa nale. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Ilaawa kete muntu yunaa khowokhaa pakhaye khopeta kho mosenjo ne khovalekela vatomami vakwe vakunage nyoomba, ne khovagawela kela muntu no molemo gwakwe, apenee khomomela avivyoo molendeleli wa molyango ikhale miso. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Gechoo mwiyandalelage, kho nguno mokhamanya muntu wa nyoomba alatuwa nale, hamo alatuwa mesee ao otikho wa manane ao makingilima panaa njogolo kewekha ao melawo. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Mbe ije khwa khotimpukelya, akiije avapikhe mwagonaga. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Egoo ganaa nkovaweela onywenywe, nkovaweela vensi, mwiyandalelage.”<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s">Njela ya khomoulaga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mateo 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1">Luka 22:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohana 11:45-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Angile jesigile nsiko jewele topo khopikha wenga wa Pasakha ne wenga ya mikate yenaa ikhatulwa amila. Vapumya matambekho ne valaangi va njaanga alevakhopooga njela ya khomogweela Yesu khwa osweki no khomoulaga. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Ila alevapala, “khokhanoje mpola eye kho ituungo la wenga Pasakha, kho nguno vantu vakiije vanojee iwo.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khopakhwa makuta okhoo Betania</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mateo 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yohana 12:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Yesu panaa aleapwale okhoo Betania kholyaa endya ya mesee khokhaye pa Simoni yunaa angile atite malimwa. Maye yomwi aleijaa ne nsopa yenaa ekhonogelelwa kho ibwee la Alabasta, yenaa angile itite makuta matukeleli ganaa gakhogolwa khwa mpia nyinki, apwataa nsopa eyoo no khomwitelelya Yesu makuta egoo khwi itwe.<verse eid="MRK 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Vantu vamoonga vanaa alevapwale epoo, alevapalana venee kho venee, “Kho kee khotomelaa makuta ega vibe? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Makuta ega anga avakhowola khogolyaa khwa mpia nyinki modugo, ne mpia ejoo khovapeela vapeena.” Vamokhakela vikhakha maye oyoo.<verse eid="MRK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Ila Yesu aleavawelaa, “Kho kee mokhomogayanjaa? Moleki maye oyo, kho nguno anojelagaa mpola nsoga modugo. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Vapeena mopwale nanevo nsiko jensi, namokhowola khovaalya ituungo lelensi lenaa amotogwa. Ila onene amba nkha palomwi nanywi nsiko jensi. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Omwene anojagaa lenaa akhowolagaa, agwitekelajaa mowele gwaane makuta ili khwandalela mazyeekho gaane. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Nkhovaweela khapanga, kho lwande yeyensi pa liwelelo panaa Mpola Nsoga elatengwa, empola eye yenaa anojagaa maye oyo, lelapalwa kho nguno ya khomokombola mwenee.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda wa Isikalioti khomogalokha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mateo 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luka 22:3-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Apenee Yuda wa Isikalioti, yomwi wa evoo vahemba ikomi ne vawele Yesu, aleapeta kho vapumya matambekho valaala ili amogalokhe Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Vapumya laala matambekho valaal va Matuunda panaaa alevategela mpola ejoo, alevatogwa, alevalamolapela valamopela Yuda mpia. Apenee andyaa khopooga njela ya khomogalokha Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kholya endya ya Pasakha ne vahemba vakwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mateo 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14">Luka 22:14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohana 13:21-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Nsiko ya kwandya ya wenga ya mikate yenaa ikhatulwa amila, nsiko yenaa nkholo wa pasakha yenaa kesenjwa, vahemba va Yesu alevamowolya, “Mbi khopooga khopete khweni ili khokhwandalele endya ya Pasakha?”<verse eid="MRK 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Apenee Yesu avatoma vahemba vakwe vawele avawela, “Mopete kho ihala, okhoo moliitanga no mogwisha yomwi akepolagaa ngeelo ya meje. Mwiije momolonde, <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />mpakha pakhaye yenaa aliingela, momowele mokhalakhaye, ‘Molaangi khowolyaa, kele khwenii chumba chaane kho nguno ya vahenja monaa ndaalya endya ya Pasakha palomwi ne vahemba vaane?’ <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Nanuyo khavalageela chumba kekolo kenaa kepwale pachanya mwigolofa kenaa chandalelagwa no khonogelelwaa visoga. Onywenywe mokhwandalele endya ya Pasakha omoo.” <verse eid="MRK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Evoo vahemba vawele alevawookha vapeta kho ihala, vapikha kela kento kete venaa Yesu aleavawelaga. Gechoo vandaa endya pasakha.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Panaa aleyapikha mesee, Yesu aleiija no khowaa ne palomwi ne vahemba vakwe ikomi ne vawele omoo. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Panaa alevakholya endya, Yesu aleapala, “Nkhovaweela khapanga, yomwii wenyu yunaa kholyaa palomwi nane, alangalokha.”<verse eid="MRK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Epoo vahemba vakwe alevasaaya, kela yomwi aleandya khomowolya Yesu, “Mbi, amba onene Odaada?”<verse eid="MRK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Yesu avawelaa, a yomwi wenyu onywenywe ikomi ne vawele, oyo yunaa khodobyaa mokate mwibakuli palomwi nane. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Khapanga, Mwana wa Muntu alaafwa kete venaa aleyandekhwa kho Maandekho ga Matuunda, ila amba magayo makolo khwa muntu yunaa khomogalokhaa Mwana wa Muntu kho nguno alagaya. Anga amba visoga mbe muntu oyoo anga akhalelwe.<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Endya ya mesee ya Odaada</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mateo 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Vakolinto 11:23-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Panaa alevakholya, Yesu aleasolaa mokate no khogolombela masoga khwa Matuunda, apalaa, agomegan'ya, avapelaa vahemba vakwe, no khovaweela, “Solagi molyee, ogo a mowele gwaane.” <verse eid="MRK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Apenee asolaa kekhombe kenaa ketite divai, asongelaa khwa Matuunda, avapelaa vahemba vakwe, ne vensi alevang'weela khwa khotomela kekhombe echoo. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Yesu avawelaa, “Eye ayenee chaji yaane ya ilekhano ya Matuunda ne vantu, yenaa ketekhaa kho nguno ya vantu vinki. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Khapanga nkhovaweela, khotopo ng'weele khanke divai ya zabibu mpakha panaa ndang'wela divai mpyaa kho Wami wa Matuunda.”<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Apenee valeveemba lwembo no khopeta kho ketonda cha Mizeituni.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khopalaa kete vahemba vakwe valamolekha</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mateo 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohana 13:36-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Yesu avawela vahemba vakwe, “Nywenywe vensi molankembela no khondekha, kho nguno yandekwile kho mandekho ya Matuunda kete, ‘Ndamokhowa mosoongi nanewo nkholo valasambala,’ <verse eid="MRK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Ila panaa ndafufokha, ndavalongola khopeta Galilaya.”<verse eid="MRK 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Petulo amowelaa, “Ninga mbe vensi valakholekha, onene khotopo nkholeke!” <verse eid="MRK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Yesu amowela Petulo, “Nhowela khapanga, otikhu owu, panaa njogolo alaawa akhale khowekha mala jewele, olapala mala jetato kete okhamanya.”<verse eid="MRK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Ila Petulo alendelela khokhandamelelya khopaala, “Ninga mbe ndalomwa khofwa palomwi nagwe, khotopo nkholeke.” Vahemba vensi naneno vapala avivyoo.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kholombaa kho busitani ya Getisemane</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:35-46">Mateo 26:35-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luka 22:39-46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Apenee vapeta kho lwande yenaa alekeetwa Getisemane. Yesu avawela vahemba vakwe, “Mwikhalage epa panaa amba onene mpetile okhoo kholoomba.” <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Apenee avasolaa Petulo no Yakhobo no Yohana. Nanoyo andyaa khosiima modugo no khogaya momooyo gwakwe. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Avawelaa, “Mooyo gwaane gwijolaga masiimo, mpakha ndepepi mfwee. Ikhalagi epa no khwiyandalela.”<verse eid="MRK 14:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Apenee aleapetaa paolongolo kedoo, abudama alombaa apalaa, amba visoga mbe khalekha khokela ituungo eloo la magayo. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Apalaa, “Abba, emaana yakwe Daada yaane, khwako mpola jensi khojekhowola. Nkholomba ompumelye magayo ega, ila ikhawe kete venaa mpogile, ila kete venaa khotogwa gwegwe.”<verse eid="MRK 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Apenee atuuwa kho vahemba evoo vatato, avapikha vatindilaga. Apenee amowolya Petulo, “Simoni, mbi, wagonaga? Mbi, okhakowola khomoloomba Matuunda ninga kho ituungo lemwi?” <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Apenee, avawelaa, “Mwikhalage miso no kholoomba, ili mokhiije mwingele momagemo. Mooyo gokhotogwaa, ila mowele gotokhola ngulu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Apetaa, khanke kholoomba apalaa mpola ajijoo. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Apenee atuuwa khanke kho vahemba vakwe avapikha vakhotindila. Kho nguno miso gawe alegijolaga ndoolo. Nanevo alevakhamanya lakhomowela.<verse eid="MRK 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Panaa Yesu aleatuuwa kho mala ya otato, aleavawela, “Mokhale mokhotindila no khosuupa? Lawelagi seji, ituungo lapikhaga, Mwana wa Muntu khogalokhwa no kholekhwa khwa vantu vanaa vatite mabe. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Lawilagi, khopetage, oyoo yunaa khongalokhaa alepepi khopikha.”<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khogwelwaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mateo 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yohana 18:3-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Apaponye Yesu panaa aleakhale khopalaa, Yuda yomwi wa evoo vahemba ikomi ne vawele apikha palomwi ne idale la vantu vanaa vatite nsiime ne malungu. Vantu ewoo alewatomwile ne vapumya matambekho valaala ne valaangi va njaanga ne vakhombi va Izilaeli. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Seji Yuda oyoo yunaa aleamogalukha Yesu, aleavapalaga vantu evoo lomekho eye, “Yunaa ndamosona amwenee mwiije momogwelage oko mwamotola panse ne khomolendelelya.”<verse eid="MRK 14:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Yuda panaa aleapikha topo, aleamopetela Yesu amowela, “Molaangi!” Apenee amosona. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Apenee, evoo vantu alevamogwela Yesu, vamotola panse ne khomolendelelya. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Apenee yomwi wa evoo vanaa alevapwale kho lwande wa Yesu yunaa angile alepepi nanoyo, asomolaa mpanga yakwe no khomodomola itwi motomami wa mopumya matambekho molaala.<verse eid="MRK 14:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Ila Yesu avawelaa, “Mbi, mwijaga ne mpanga ne malungu khongwela kete onene a mosuki? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Nsiko jensi alempwale palomwi ne nywenywe nkoliga kho nyoomba ya Matuunda, ninga alemokhangwela, ila seji lazima Maandekho ga Matuunda gadugame.” <verse eid="MRK 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Apenee vahemba vakwe vensi alevamolekha no khokembela.<verse eid="MRK 14:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Molomyana yomwi yunaa angile ikumbaga mwenda mwelo topo, nanoyo alekhomolonda Yesu, panaa alevamogweela, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />alekhaa mwenda gwakwe gwa khwikuumba no khokembela oko alebwiinda.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu paolongolo la ivaanza ikolo la Vayahudi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Mateo 26:57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54">Luka 22:54</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:55">55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13">Yohana 18:13</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:14">14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Apenee, vamokenkha Yesu kho mopumya matambekho molaala wa Matuunda, panaa vapumya matambekho valaala va Matuunda vensi, vakhombi va Izilaeli ne valaangi va njaanga ja Musa vensi alevikhungan'ya palomwi. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Petulo aleamolondelelyaa Yesu khotale, mpakha kho lokinga khwa mopumya matambekho molaala, ikhalaa palomwi ne valindeleli oko vakhota moto. <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Vapumya matambekho valaala ne ivaanza lensi alevapoga owoni wa khomositacha Yesu ili vakhowole khomowolaga ila alevakhapata. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Vantu vinki angile wapumyaa mpola ja opepi khomougela Yesu, mpola jawe jekhapyana. <verse eid="MRK 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Apenee vantu vaange aleviimelela vapalaa mpola ja opepi khomougela Yesu vapalaa, <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />“Osweswe alekhwamotegeela khopalaa, ‘Ambomola nyoomba eye ya Matuunda, yenaa aleyajengwa ne mekhono ja vantu, kho nsiko jetato ndajenga nyoomba yeenge yenaa ikhajegwa ne mekhono ja vantu.’ ” <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Ila ninga gechoo, mpola ja vantu alejekhapyana.<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Epoo mopumya matambekho molaala, imelelaa paolongolo yawe, amowolya Yesu, “Mbi, ogwegwe khotopo opaale khapanga yakhoo, khokhowugela ogwegwe?” <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Ila Yesu ikhala myaa, ale akhapala ninga mpola yeyensi. Molaala wa mofumya matambekho amowolya khanke, “Mbi, ogwegwe amwene kilisto, Mwana wa Matuunda yunaa Khokhomokholya?” <verse eid="MRK 14:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Yesu amowela, “Onene, amwene, molamowona Mwana wa Muntu yunaa ikhala kho mokhono wa molyelo wa ngulu, kiija ne malunde ya pachanya ya Matuunda.” <verse eid="MRK 14:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Mopumya matambekho molaala ademolaa mwenda gwakwe, apalaa “Mbi, khole nguno ya khopooga vawoni vaange? <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Onywenywe vensi mwategela venaa khomotokhaa Matuunda. Onywenywe mokholamola mbi?” Vensi alevaloma awolagwe.<verse eid="MRK 14:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Apenee, vantu vamoonga alevandya khomotyela matye, vamotuunga ketambala momiso, vamodokulanga no khomoweela, “Lotaa ananuu yunaa akhokowaa.” Nanevo valindeleli alevamopatulanga makhofi.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo khomositaa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Mateo 26:69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luka 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yohana 18:15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Petulo panaa aleakhale apwale kho lokinga oloo, mwalele yomwii yunaa angile matomami wa mopumya matambekho molaala aleijaa. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Panaa aleamowona Petulo khootaa moto, aleamokunaa modugo, amowelaa, “Ninga nagwe angile opwale palomwi no Yesu Monazaleti.” <verse eid="MRK 14:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Ila Petulo asitaa, apalaa, “Nkhamanya, ninga nkhelewa kenaa khopaala.” Apenee Petulo apumaa, apetaa kho njela ya khwingelela. <verse eid="MRK 14:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Motomami oyoo wa kekhiima panaa aleamowona Petulo khanke, aleavawela vanto evoo vanaa angile vimelelaga epoo, “Muntu oyoo a yomwi wawe,” <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Ila petulo asitaa khanke.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:70">Ituungo panaa lakela vantu vanaa alevemaga nanuyo vamowela, “Khapanga ogwegwe a yomwi wawe, kho nguno ogwegwe ole Mogalilaya.” <verse eid="MRK 14:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Ila petulo aleandyaa khololoma no kholapa kete, “Nkhamomanya muntu yunaa mokhomopalela.”<verse eid="MRK 14:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Apaponye njogolo yawekha mala ya owele. Apenee, petulo akhombola mpola yenaa Yesu aleamowelaa, kete, “Panaa njogolo alaawa akhale khowekha mala jewele, olapala mala jetato kete okhamanya.” Apene Petulo aleadagadaa no khwandya khokoota.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s">Yesu khokenkhwa khwa Mwami Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mateo 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luka 23:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yohana 18:28-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Makingilima, vapumya matambekho valaala ne vakhombi va Izilaeli ne valaangi va njaanga ja Musa, alevigombya, vamotunge Yesu ngosa, vamosola no khomokenkha khwa Mwami Pilato. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Pilato amowolya Yesu, “Mbi, ogwegwe amwene mwami wa Vayahudi?” Yesu amowelaa, “Egoo khopaala ogwegwe.” <verse eid="MRK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Vapumya matambekho valaala vamositacha Yesu kho mpola nyinki, <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Kho gechoo, Pilato amowolya khanke Yesu, “Mbi, otokhola la khopaala? Kunaa vantu ewa va khokositacha kho mpola jiinga.” <verse eid="MRK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Ila Yesu aleakhapala mpola, ninga Pilato aleakhumya.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khotengemekhwa khofwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mateo 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yohana 18:39-19:16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Kela panaa wenga wa Pasakha panaa yapikha, Vayahudi aleavadigolelaga motungwa yomwi yunaa vantu alevamotogagwa, angile vakhonoja gechoo kela mwakha. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Ituungo eloo aleapwale muntu yomwi yunaa khwetwa Balaba, yunaa aleatungilwe palomwi ne vayakwe vanaa vagaloki khwa khokenkelya obe wa maulagi. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Vantu vinki alevamopetela Pilato vamoloomba avanojela kete venaa alekhanojaga. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Pilato avawolya, “Mbi, mokhopooga mbadigolele Mwami wa Vayahudi?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Pilato aleapala gechoo kho nguno aleamanya vapumya matambekho valaala va Matuunda alevamokenkha Yesu khwakwe kho nguno ya wilu wawe.<verse eid="MRK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Ila vapumya matambekho valaala va Matuunda alevakhosongan'ya vantu vamolombe Pilato amodigolele Balaba. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Pilato avawolya khanke, “Mbi, mokhopooga nojee kee khwa muntu oyo yunaa mokhomweta Mwami wa Vayahudi?”<verse eid="MRK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Vantu vensi alevakhojoma no khopaala “Mokhoweleli pa mosalaba!”<verse eid="MRK 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Pilato avawolya vantu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:14">“Mbi! Anogaja obe kee?” Ila evenee vendelela khojomaa mudogo, “Mokhoweleli pa mosalaba!”<verse eid="MRK 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Pilato aleapooga kholetojwa idale eloo la vantu, apenee amodigolela Balaba khopuma mokhandulunge. Alagelelya masinjala vakwe vamotame Yesu nkome no khomokhowelela pa mosalaba.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masinjala alevakhomobyeda Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Mateo 27:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2">Yohana 19:2</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 19:3">3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Apenee, masinjala vamokenkha Yesu mpakha mokhate ya nyoomba ya Mwami wa Yudea, vakongaanya idale lensi la masinjala.<verse eid="MRK 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Vamolyekha Yesu nkhanzu nkhasuku ya wami, vanogelelyaa nkhofila ya miya no khomolyekha khwiitwe. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Vandyaa khomolamocha khwa khomokilyaa, “Ole mopanga Mwami wa Vayahudi.” <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Alevamokhowa ne nkhome ya mwanzi khwiitwe no khomotyeela matye, vawa vakhomotungamela kete vakhomokholya ili vamobyeede. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Panaa alevamalya khomobyeda, vamolyola mwenda nkhanzu yakwe nkhasuku no khomolyekha khanke myenda jakhwe, apenee vamopumya panji ya nyoomba ya wami no khowokhaa nanoyo khopeta khomokhomelela pa mosalaba.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khokhomelelwa pa mosalaba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mateo 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohana 19:17-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Panaa alevapwale monjela, alevitaanga no muntu yomwi yunaa khwetwa Simoni, yunaa khopumela Kulene. Mwenee angile daada yawe Alekizanda no Lufo, no khwiitungo kedo alekhopumela kho mogoonda. Apenee vamowela akepule mosalaba wa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Apenee vamokenkha Yesu mpakha lwande panaa pakhwetwa Goligota, emaana yakwe, “Lwande ya ibanka la itwe”. <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Vamopela divai yenaa isalinkine ne oganga wa ipeke la manemane, ila Yesu aleasitaa khoyen'gweela. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Apenee, vamokhomelela pa mosalaba. Vigawan'ya myenda jakwe khokowela osaguli ili khowona ananuu alapata mwenda kee. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Ituungo lenaa alevamokhomelela Yesu pa mosalaba, angile ituungo la saa jetato melaawo.<verse eid="MRK 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Pachanya ya mosalaba gwakwe alevandekha, “Mwami wa Vayahudi.” <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Yesu aleakhomelelwa pa mosalaba, palomwi ne vasuki vawele, yomwi aleapwale lwande ya molyelo ne yoonge lwande ya mukege. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />Epoo apenee alegadugama Maandekho ga Matuunda ganaa gakhopaala, “Aleasolelwa kete muntu yunaa atite mabe.”<verse eid="MRK 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Vantu vanaa alevakhokela epoo, alevatokha no vakhoyongan'ya mitwe jawe no khopaala khwa lolii ikolo, “Aliii! Ogwegwe yunaa alewapaala olabomola nyoomba ya Matuunda no khojeenga kho nsiko jetato, <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />seji, telemokha pa mosalaba, wipon'ye gwegwee.”<verse eid="MRK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Nanevo vapumya matambekho valaala va Matuunda palomwi ne valaangi va njaanga ja Musa alevakhomobyeeda no khopaala, “Omwene aleavapon'ya vaange, ila omwene akhonyaga khwipon'ya. <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Lekhaa khomowone Kilisto oyoo, Mwami wa Izilaeli, seji atelemokhe khopuma pachanya pa mosalaba, naswi kholamogomba.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:32">Ne vantu evoo vawele vanaa ninga nanevo alevakhomelelwa pa mosalaba alevamotokha.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khofwaa pa Mosalaba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mateo 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohana 19:28-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Panaa aleyapikha ituungo la saa sita ya lyonse, liwelelo lensi aleyaigubikha kitii mpakha ituungo la saa tisa. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Kho ituungo la saa tisa, Yesu aleajomaa lolii lokolo, apalaa, “Eloi, Eloi, lema sabakitani?” Emaana yakwe “Matuunda waane, Matuunda waane, kho kee wandekhaga?” <verse eid="MRK 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Vantu vamoonga vanaa aleveemaga pepi, panaa alevategeela gechoo, alevapaala, “Motegeleli, khomwetaa Eliya.” <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Muntu yomwii aleakembelaa lowelo, adobya siponji mo divai yenaa yasasagaa, asopekhaa pachanya ya mwanzi, anyenyolaa no khomopeela Yesu ang'weele oko khopalaa, “Lekhaa khowone mbe Eliya aliija khomotelemola pa mosalaba.”<verse eid="MRK 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Apenee Yesu ajomaa kho lolii nkolo, afwaa.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Ituungo aleloo, lepazia la nyoomba ya Matuunda, alelademokha vebaande vewele khwandelya pachanya mpakha panse. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Molaala wa masinjala yunaa aleemagaa epoo paolongolo wa mosalaba wa Yesu, panaa aleategeela oloo lolii lwakwe no khowona venaa khofwaa, apalaa, “Khapanga, muntu oyo angile Mwana wa Matuunda!”<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Alevapwale ne vakhiima vanaa alevakhomokunaa khotale, mo vamoonga vawe aleapwale Malia yunaa khopumaa Magidala no Malia maye yawe Yakhobo mulunaakwe Yose no Salome. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Vakhiima evoo alevakhomotomekela Yesu panaa aleapwale Galilaya no khomotomekela. Alevapwale ne vakhiima vaange vinki vanaa aleviija palomwi nanuyo Yelusalemu.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khotulwa mwikhabuli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mateo 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohana 19:38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Panaa aleyapikhaa mesee, kho nguno angile nsiko ya Wiyandaleli kho nguno ya Nsiko ya Khosuupa, <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Yusufu yunaa aleapuma Alimatayo, muntu yunaa aleakoliwa mudogo kho ivaanza la Vayahudi, omwenee nanoyo alekhokunelelya khwija kho wami wa Matuunda. Aleamopetela Pilato patokhola khotungumala no khomolomba agosole movimba gwa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Pilato aleakumya panaa aleategeela kete Yesu afwagaa. Amwetaa oyoo molaala wa masinjala, amowolya kete Yesu aleafwaga. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Pilato panaa aleawelwa no molaala oyoo wa masinjala kete Yesu aleafwaga, apenee Pilato aleamogombela Yusufu apete agosole movimba gwa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Yusufu nanuyo aleagola shanda ya bei nkolo, awotelemola movimba wa Yesu khopuma pa mosalaba, aupilimilya shanda eyoo. Agotolaa mokhabuli lenaa laponjagwa pa mogamba apenee alibilingitya ibwe ikholo kholemba pa molyango wa khabuli. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Malia wa khopuma Magidala no Malia maye wakwe Yose alevawona panaa movimba wa Yesu alegwatolagwa.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s">Yesu khofufokhaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mateo 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohana 20:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Panaa aleyakela Nsiko ya Khosuupa, Malia wa khopuma Magidala no Salome no Malia maye wakwe Yakhobo alevagola makhuta ga khotokela ili vaopake movimba gwa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Makingilima, nsiko ya khwandya ya wiki, alevapeta kho khabuli panaa aleatolagwa Yesu panaa lyonse aleladolaga. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Panaa alevapwale mo njela, alevakhwiwolya venee kho veene, “Ananuu yunaa khatowokelya ibwe pa molyango gwa khabuli?” <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Ila panaa alevapikha, alevawona ibwe ikolo lawochagwa khopuma epoo pa molyango wa khabuli.<verse eid="MRK 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Panaa alevingela mo khabuli, alevamowona molomyana yunaa alyalaga mwenda mwelo ikhalagaa kho lwande lwa molyelo, alevatungumala. <verse eid="MRK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Ila molomyana oyoo aleavawelaa, “Mokhatungumale! Mokhomopooga Yesu Mnazaleti, yunaa aleakhomelwe pa mosalaba. Afufokhaga! Epa atapoya, kunagi panaa alevamotulaga. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Ila mopete momowele Petulo palomwi ne vahemba vakwe vaange, mbe, ‘Khovalongolaa khopeta Galilaya. Okhoo molamowona kete venaa aleavawelagaa.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Gechoo, vapuma lowelo mo ipinga, okhoo vakhotetema no khokumya alevakhamowela muntu yeyensi kento chechensi, kho nguno alevatungumala.<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khomopomelaa Malia wa khopuma Magidala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mateo 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Yohana 20:11-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Yesu panaa aleafufokha nsiko ya khwandya ya wiki melaawo, aleamopemela Malia wa khopuma Magidala, yunaa Yesu aleamopumya mademi saba. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Malia nanoyo aleapetaa khovawela evoo vanaa alevapwale palomwi no Yesu, panaa aleakhale khofwa, ne ituungo eloo lenaa alevakhombolelya no khokoota. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Ila panaa alevategeela kete Yesu a mopanga, no Malia wa khopuma Magidala aleamowonagaa, alevakhagomba.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khovapumelaa vahemba vakwe vawele</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Luka 24:13-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Panaa alegakela egoo, Yesu aleavapumela vahemba vawele oko atite mwigelo woonge. Vahemba evoo alevakhopeta kho mogoonda. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Nanevo panaa alevamotembola, alevatuuwa khokhaye ili vawawele vayawe. Ila ninga venee alevakhavagombela.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khovapumela vahemba ikomi no yomwi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mateo 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohana 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Manoji 1:6-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Panaa, Yesu avapumela vahemba vakwe evoo ikomi no yomwi, panaa alevakholya endya. Avakhakela modugo kho nguno ya khokonya khogoomba khwawe, no khokonya khovagombela evoo vanaa alevamowonaga panaa aleafufokhagaa. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Apenee avawela, “Petagi kho liwelelo jensi moteenge Mpola Nsoga khwa kela kiumbe. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Muntu yeyensi yunaa khogombaa no khobatijwa alanokholwa. Ila muntu yeyensi yunaa akhakhogomba alatengemekhwa. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Lomekho eje jelanojwa ne vanaa vakhogoomba, khwa lina laane valapumya mademi no khopaala khwa melombelo mepyaa, <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />valawamba njokha kho mekhono jawe, ninga mbe valang'weela kenaa kekhowulaga, khotopo vafwee, valawatola mekhono yawe khwa valwile, nanevo valapona.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khosolwa kopeta kho pachanya pa Matuunda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luka 24:50-53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Manoji 1:9-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Odaada Yesu panaa aleamalya khopaala nanevo, aleasolwaa no khokenkhwa pachanya pa Matuunda, no khwikhala kho mokhono wa molelyo wa Matuunda. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Apenee vahemba vakwe alevapeta khoteenga kela lwande. Nanoyo Odaada anogajaa molemo palomwi nanevo no kholageela mpola yakwe khwa lomekho jenaa alejelondan'ya nanelo.<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>